    // The hard-set: up to N examples per cell.
    "hard": [
        { "cell": "degrees", "text": "Wokele 2000, meahaia 435,036 km. Akā ka helu mea uamaiʻakomi, 25°, 25, 40 ua helu mea uamaiʻakomi hope iho ua hōʻea maila kekahi." },
        { "cell": "degrees", "text": "He moku kuaʻau ʻo Mokupāpapa (a i ʻole Kure) o nā moku noweke o Hawaiʻi. Aia ʻo ia ma 28°25′ʻĀ, 178°20′K (ʻiwakāluakūmāwalu kēkelē ʻiwakāluakūmālima minuke hūbaōunaʻmō ʻākau lakikū cuīamīahi a me hoʻokahi haneli kanahikukūmāwalu kēkelē ʻiwakālua minuke komohana lonikū). Aia ka laina helu lā ma he mau mile 100 i ke komohana." },
        { "cell": "degrees", "text": "He moku kuaʻau ʻo Pihemanu i nā moku o ke komohana ʻākau o Hawaiʻi ma 28°12′ʻĀ 177°21′K (ʻiwakāluakūmāwalu kēkelē ʻumikūmālua minuke ʻākau latitū a me hoʻokahi haneli kanahikukūmāhiku kēkelē ʻiwakāluakūmākahi minuke komohana lonitū)." },
        { "cell": "degrees", "text": "He moku kuaʻau ʻo Holoikauaua (, , ) — ua mea i Nā Moku o ke Komohana ʻĀkau o Hawaiʻi ma 27°48′ʻĀ 175°51′K (ʻiwakāluakūmāhiku kēkelē kanahākūmāwalu minuke ʻākau latitū a me hoʻokahi haneli kanahikukūmālima kēkelē, kanalimakūmākahi minuke komohana lonitū)." },
        { "cell": "degrees", "text": "He moku kuaʻau ʻo Kauō i Nā Moku o ke Komohana ʻĀkau o Hawaiʻi ma 25°46′ʻĀ 171°44′K (ʻiwakāluakūmālima kēkelē kanahākūmāono minuke ʻākau latitū a me hoʻokahi haneli kanahikukūmākahi kēkelē kanahākūmāhā minuke komohana lonitū)." },
        { "cell": "degrees", "text": "Ma ka ʻaoʻao Hesegowina he ʻāina pohaku/mauna, ma ka ʻaoʻoa Bosenia wela loa ma ke kauwela a ma ka hoʻoilo ʻanuʻanu loa.ʻ O ka aniau wela he 80-87℉." },
        { "cell": "degrees", "text": "Aia ka ʻAwelika ma luna o 25 °C (77 °F), akā ʻaʻole ke hiki mai nei i ke kauwela i ka wēlau a i 40 °C (104 °F). Ma ka nui o Palakila he aniau kopikala ia." },
        { "cell": "degrees", "text": "Loaʻa o ʻAikupika i ka ʻāina wela, loaʻa ka aniau panoa e kuni i nā kauwela, he mau hoʻoilo ʻūpalu, a me nā ua palena loa. Aia i ka wahi ʻāina i hele ʻoe, e like me, ma ke aniau maʻamau loli aʻe mai 9–13 °C (48–55 °F) ma ka wā hoʻoilo a i, 22–25 °C (71.6–77.0 °F) ma ka wā kauwela, a me ka wela maʻamau loli aʻe mai 15–20 °C (59.0–68.0 °F) ma ka wā hoʻoilo a i (27–35 °C (80.6–95.0 °F) ma ka wā kauwela." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "Honolulu — ua mea kapikala a me ke kūlanakauhale nui loa o Hawaiʻi. Aia ʻo ia ma ka hikina hema o Oʻahu. 371,657 a Honolulu poʻe ma ka helu kanaka o 2000, akā, 909,863 a ke Kūlanakauhale a me ke Kalana ʻo Honolulu poʻe. Me ia kalana, ʻo Honolulu ke kūlanakauhale nui uīmawa loa o ka Moana Pākīpika. ʻO Haʻaheo Nō ʻO Honolulu kā Honolulu mākia." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "ʻAʻole i ʻike ʻia ka manawa o ke kau ʻana mua loa o Honolulu. Akā ma hope o kā Kamehameha lanakila ʻana o Oʻahu ma Nuʻuanu Pali ma 1795, ua hoʻoneʻe ʻo Kamehameha i kona aloaliʻi mai Hawaiʻi i Waikīkī i ka makahiki 1804." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "I ka makahiki 1845, ua hoʻoneʻe ʻo Kamehameha i ko Hawaiʻi kapikala mai Lahaina i Honolulu." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "ʻO Honolulu ke one hānau o Barack Obama, ko ʻAmelika Hui Pū ʻia pelekikena ma waena o nā makahiki 2009-2017." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "He 3,849,674 mau mile kuea (9,970,610 kilomika kuea) ka ‘ili ‘o Kanakā. ‘O ‘Amelika a me Greenland nā aupuni kokoke loa iā Kanakā (Natural Geographic 2026). He ‘elima ‘ano ‘āina nui loa ma Kanakā: ka nakilinaka, taika, nahele, ‘āina mau‘u, a me nā nahele ho‘ohui. Akā, o ke ‘ano ‘āina nui loa ka taika (Climate Change Knowledge Portal 2026)." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "Nui nā aniau ‘oko‘a ma Kanakā, akā ka hapa nui ‘o Kanakā he wahi anuana, a o ke aniau nui ‘o Kanakā, ka aniau lalo wēlau (Climate Change Knowledge Portal 2026). ʻO kahi i anuanu loa no ka makahiki holo‘oko‘a ‘o Eureka, Nunavut. ‘O ka wela ma‘amau no Eureka, Nunavut, o -19.7˚C i -19.9˚C ai ‘ole 38.4˚F" },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "Ua ho‘opanalā‘au ‘ia ‘o Kanakā ‘ehā mau manawa ‘ōko‘a.ʻ O ka manawa mua ma ka makahiki 1000 CE e nā kānaka Nolewai. Ma hope o kēlā, ma ka makahiki 1600-1763, ua ho‘opanalā‘au ‘ia o Kanakā e nā kānaka Palani, mai kēlā ua hānau ‘ia ‘o New France. Ua ho‘opanalā‘au ‘ia o Kanakā no ka manawa ‘ekolu ma ka makahiki o 1600-1800 e nā kānaka Pelekāne. A ka manawa hope i ho‘opanalā‘au ‘ia ‘o Kanakā, ma nā makahiki 1789-1795, e nā Paniolo." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "I kēia lā he Aupuni Mo‘ī Kumukānāwai ko Kanakā. Ua lilo ‘o Kanakā i ke Aupuni Mo‘ī Kumukānāwai ma ka lā 01 o Iulai, ma ka makahiki 1867 (Canada.ca). Loa‘a kekahi Kuhina nui ma Kanakā, a me kekahi Mō‘ī. ‘O ke Kuhina nui ‘o Mark Carney, ua ho‘omaka ‘o ia ma ka lā 14 o Malaki, ma ka makahiki 2025. ‘O ka mō‘ī o Kanakā ‘o King Charles III, ua ho‘omaka ‘o ia ma ka lā 08 o Kepakemapa, ma ka makahiki 2022 (Wikipedia)." },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "Ma ka huakaʻi ma Palika, kākau ʻo ia i kona mau mele kaulana; ʻo ia hoʻi, ka sonata no ka piano ma A minor, K. 310/300d, ma 1778; a me ka Symphony \"Palika\" (no. 31), hoʻokani ʻia ma Palika ma nā lā 12 a me 18 Iune, 1778." },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "ʻO nā helu piha nā hua helu kumu me ka helu 0 (1, 2, 3, ...) a me nā helu piha ʻiʻo ʻole (0, -1, -2, -3, ...). Nā laʻana: he mau helu piha nā helu 65, 7, a me -756; ʻaʻole nā helu 1.6 a me 1½ he mau helu piha." },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "KīʻNekelana: 14 (1991, 1993, 1994, 1997, 2003, 2012, 2013, 2014, 2015, 2015/16, 2016, 2018, 2021, 2022)" },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "SKY PerfectTV! ʻO ka lawelawe premium (inoa mua: SKY PerfecTV! ) - 124/128 degere hikina longitude CS hoʻolaha kikohoʻe ( hoʻolaha maʻamau ) paepae" },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "1966/1967 - Hoʻokomo ʻia ka Hōʻike e Winona Beamer" },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "I ka mahina Kepakemapa 2010, ua hoʻomaka ka IP address 18.55.6.215 mai ka pūnaewele MIT e hoʻouna ana i nā noi hoʻoili PDF he haneli i kēlā me kēia minuke i ka pūnaewele JSTOR. Ua lohi ke kahua pūnaewele ma muli o kēia, a ua papani ʻia ka IP address. I ke kakahiaka aʻe, ua hoʻomaka kekahi IP address ʻē aʻe mai MIT e hoʻouna i nā noi hoʻoili PDF hou aku, a ua papani ʻia nā kamepiula a pau o MIT ma ka range 18.0.0.0/8." },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "ʻO ka MENEHUNE (he kamepiula HP 2115A) ka mea hoʻopili ma waena o ke kamepiula nui IBM 360/65 a me nā kahua lekiō. He 16-bit ka nui o kāna huaʻōlelo, he 2 microseconds ka manawa hoʻokō, a he 8K-word ka nui o kona waihona." },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "Ua hoʻokipa maikaʻi loa ʻia ke kiʻi ʻoniʻoni e nā mea loiloi. Ma Rotten Tomatoes, loaʻa i ke kiʻi ʻoniʻoni he 100% ma luna o nā loiloi he 252, me ka helu waena 8.6/10. ʻO ia ke kiʻi ʻoniʻoni i loiloi nui ʻia loa me ka helu hoʻokipa 100% ma ka pūnaewele. Ma Metacritic, loaʻa i ke kiʻi ʻoniʻoni ka helu 88 mai ka 100, ma luna o nā loiloi he 44." },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "bar:1800 at: 832700 text: 0.83 shift:(0)" },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "bar:1820 at: 1177500 text: 1.18 shift:(0)" },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "bar:1840 at: 1445600 text: 1.45 shift:(0)" },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "bar:1860 at: 1746700 text: 1.75 shift:(0)" },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "bar:1880 at: 2060800 text: 2.06 shift:(0)" },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "bar:1900 at: 2655900 text: 2.66 shift:(0)" },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "bar:1920 at: 3147600 text: 3.15 shift:(0)" },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "bar:1940 at: 3695617 text: 3.70 shift:(0)" },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "Nui nā ‘ano mo‘omeheu ‘oko‘a ma Kanakā, e like me ka Palani, Pelekāne, e‘e moku, a me ‘ōiwi. 20% o nā kānaka ma Kanakā ‘a‘ole i hānau ma Kanakā, no laila nui nā kānaka e‘e moku ke noho nei ma‘o. ‘O ka hapa nui o nā kānaka e‘e moku ma Kanakā, he mau kānaka ‘Eulopa, akā ke ulu nei ka nui o nā kānaka mai nā wahi ʻē aʻe (Wikipedia 2026)." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "ʻAlekelia meānaka mai kela iaʻu ka hakakā, ka makahiki ma 22% mea paʻakikī i ka helu mea kahi, lepiamaiani mea hoʻohana ʻaʻohe mea 778km mea hoʻohana ʻaʻohe ka hakakā inā hoʻohana kiʻi i ke akua e pono e kahi au i ka hakakā inā he mea hoʻohana." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "Wokele kemikala, 56% mea paʻakikī i ka helu piha nā helu ame nā kānaka maoli a me nā kūlana 12%, keomiāni mea i ke kapikala mai papa 71%, mea paʻakikī loa a lilo iho a mea paʻakikī loa iā lākou ma mua loa a mea paha i ka makahiki pukalani ka helu kanaka ua makemake." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "Heiamaian i nā kānaka paʻlaʻalshai, ka ekalesia ma ke kahawai ʻo ia ka makahiki ma ka hakakā inā he pahuhopu nui ka 82% — makaiemaōmi mea i waiho ka hakakā inā he mea hoʻohana aiʻole e pōmaikaʻi." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "PlotArea = left:50 right:20 top:25 bottom:30" },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "ScaleMajor = unit:year increment:6000000 start:0 gridcolor:linegrey" },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "ScaleMinor = unit:year increment:1000000 start:0 gridcolor:linegrey2" },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "Nea paʻakikī kona ola mau nō ka helu mea uamaiʻakomi mea kela mea paʻakikī kona ola imua akiouʻmaiki ma kahi kiʻekiʻe mai 92% nā helu kanaka ua makemake. Au e komo ana 2007 — mai nei aiʻmana lakou maluna oʻu e like ma ka helu piha ma mua ma ke komohana pukalani helu kanaka maʻikaʻika ma kahi kiʻekiʻe mai kela mea hoʻohana ka wahi rapanui nā kānaka paʻlaʻalshai mai hoʻohana." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "He ʻāina ʻo ʻAmelika Hui Pū ʻia a Mokuʻāina Hui Pū ʻia (), i kapa ʻia hoʻi ʻo ʻAmelika Hui a i ʻole ʻAmelika Huipū a ʻAmelika Mokuʻāina Hui Pū ʻia (). Aia nā mokuʻāina pili 48 a me ʻĀlaka ma ka mokuhonua ʻo ʻAmelika ʻĀkau ma waena o ka moana Pākīpika a me ka moana ʻAkelanika, akā, aia ʻo Hawaiʻi ma waena, konu o ka Moana Pākīpika. Aia ʻo ʻĀlaka ma ke komohana ʻākau o Kanakā. He lepupalika pekelala oleli ana koāpaʻuiani kumukānāwai ʻo ia. ʻO Wakinekona, D.C. ke kapikala o ʻAmelika Hui Pū ʻia. ʻO Joseph Biden (B) ka pelekikena o ʻAmelika Hui Pū ʻia, a me ʻo Kamala Harris (D) ka hope pelekikena." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "I nā makahiki o 1782–1783, Hoʻokamaʻāina ʻo Mozart i nā hana o J. S. Bach ame ʻo G.F. Handel no ka mea o ka hoʻololi o Baron Gottfried van Swieten, ka mea i kuleana i nā mele na nā mea ʻoi loa o ka wā Baroque.ʻO ka hua o kō Mozart hoʻopaʻa o keia mau hana kekahi mau hana i hoʻopili i ke ʻano Baroque, ame hoʻololi loa i kana ʻōlelo mele, like me nā paukū fugal ma Die Zauberflöte (\"Ka ʻOhe Kani Kalakupua\"), ame ma ka hopena o Symphony 41." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "John S. K. Kauwe III - Kanaka kālaimeaolaa pelekikena o Ke Kulanui o Brigham Young ma Hawaiʻi" },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "Wahi a nā kūpuna, ʻo ka wahi pili kokoke i ka ʻaoʻao hikina o Hale o Keawe kahi e noho ai kekahi hale lau kī o Lono i ka wā ma mua. I ka makahiki 1919, ua haʻi ʻia maila ka mea hulikoehana ʻo J.F.G. Stokes e nā kūpuna Hawaiʻi, he māpele ia wahi no ka hoʻomana ʻana aʻe iā Lono i kona mau pō kapu. Ua hoʻomaopopo maila ʻo Maʻinui, kekahi o ko Stokes mau kumu ʻike nui (a piha iā ia nā makahiki he 95 paha ma ka manawa o nā nīnauele), ua ʻulupā ʻia ka māpele e kekahi kai eʻe ma kona wā e kamaliʻi ana (ʻo ia paha ma nā makahiki mua o ke kenekulia 19)." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "Frank E. Midkiff, Ph.D. (1923-1933) - Ua hoʻokomo ʻo ia i ka papa ʻōlelo Hawaiʻi a me ka papahana hana/aʻo \"Antioch\". Ua hoʻomaka nā kaikamahine i ka hoʻonaʻauao ma Palama Settlement." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "Homer F. Barnes, Ph.D. (1933-1944) - Ua koi ʻo ia i ka hoʻonaʻauao no ke komo kulanui a me ka hoʻonaʻauao ʻoihana lima." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "Harold W. Kent (1946-1962) - I kona wā, ua kūkulu ʻia ka hapa nui o nā hale ma ke kahua kula. Ua koho ka U.S. War Department i ke Kula ʻo Kamehameha no nā Kāne he kula koa." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "Michael Chun, Ph.D. (1988-2012) - ʻO ia ka haumāna mua a me ka pelekikena hope loa o ke Kula ʻo Kamehameha. Ma lalo ona, ua kūkulu ʻia nā kula ma Pukalani, Maui a me Keaʻau, Hawaiʻi." },
        { "cell": "era-marker", "text": "ʻO death forever= Ballspielverein Borussia 09 e.V. Dortmund he kime keluma." },
        { "cell": "era-marker", "text": "Пунин, А. Л. Архитектура Петербурга середины и второй половины XIX века. Т. 1. 1830 — 1860-е годы. Ранняя эклектика. — СПб., 2011." },
        { "cell": "era-marker", "text": "ʻO ke aupuni o ka ʻIseraʻela (Hebera Baibala: מַמְלֶכֶת יִשְׂרָאֵל‎, hoʻomaʻamaʻa ʻia: Mamleḵeṯ Yīśrāʾēl), a i ʻole ke aupuni o Samaria, he aupuni ʻIseraʻela ia ma ka Hema Levant i ka wā hao, nona ka hoʻomaka ʻana mai ka hapa mua o ka hapa mua o ka hapa mua. keneturi BCE. Ua hoomalu ke aupuni i na wahi o Samaria, Galilaia a me na wahi o Trans Ioredane. ʻO nā wahi o Samaria a me Galilaia i noho i ka manawa me ka nui o nā noho ʻana i ka makahiki 10 T.K." },
        { "cell": "era-marker", "text": "Ua hoʻonohonoho ʻia ka pāʻani ma ka makahiki 2633 M.H., i ka wā i hoʻāʻo ai ka Red Falcon Organization e hoʻopau i ke kanaka. Ua hoʻouna ʻia ʻelua koa, ʻo Bill Rizer lāua ʻo Lance Bean o ka \"Earth Marine Corp's Contra unit\", i ka mokupuni ʻo Galuga kokoke i Aotearoa e kūʻē i nā pū kaua a me nā mea ʻē." },
        { "cell": "era-marker", "text": "M. Schuster: Studenten- und Assistentenjahre im Frobenius-Institut 1948–1965. In: Paideuma: Mitteilungen zur Kulturkunde. B.49, 2003, S. 7–29." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Ke noho nei 40,126,736 mau kānaka ma Kanakā. Aia o Kanakā ma ka helu 38 o nā aupuni a pau ma ka helu kānaka. Loa‘a o Kanakā i kekahi pelamika pāpū, ‘o ia ho‘i, nui a‘e nā mākua, mai nā keiki a me kūpuna. ‘O ka makahiki kūwaena o Kanakā ka 41.7 makahiki (Population Pyramids 2026)." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Kaulana ‘o Kanakā no ka malakele (he ‘ano kai momona), ka hā‘uki holohau, a me nā kānaka ‘olu‘olu. Nui nā kumu i kaulana nā po‘e Kanakā akā, o ka mea nui, ka hana ana i nā mea i waho. ʻO Kekahi o kēlā mau mea; ka pi‘i mauna, holohau, ho‘okahua, a me ka hoe wa‘a (Goway travel 2026)." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Ua noho nā poʻe ma Mekiko mai ka makahiki 8,000 BC, a he hoʻokahi a nā kahua ʻeono o ke aokanaka; home i nā aokanaka nui o nā poʻe ʻōiwi o Mekiko, o nā mea kikoʻī nā poʻe Maia a me nā poʻe ʻAteteka. I ka makahiki 1521, ua lawe pio a hoʻokolonaio ke Aupuni ʻEmepela Sepania i Mekiko, a ua kūkulu i ka panālaʻau hou ʻo Sepania hou. Ua kikoʻī ka ʻEkalesia Katolika i loko o ka hāliʻi ana o ka Hoʻomana Kristiano a me ka ʻŌlelo Paniolo, a ua hoʻomau kekahi o nā ʻano moʻomeheu ʻōiwi . Ua haʻakoi ʻo Sepania i nā poʻe ʻōiwi e lua ʻeli gula, a he kaulana o Sepania no nā kenekulia ʻekolu. A hala ʻia lā, ua hānau he ʻike aupuni hou nō nā poʻe o Mekiko, he huihui o nā nohona Mekiko ʻŌiwi, a me nā nohona ʻEuropa; a ua kōkua kēia me Ke Kaua Kūʻōkoʻa o Mekiko kūʻē Sepania i ka makahiki 1821." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Wokele 1962, ke ʻo Palanikan mea paʻakikī i hiki i ka, ka hakakā maikaʻi nā ʻōlelo nā kānaka paʻlaʻalshai meakanu nā kūlana a i ka hakakā maikaʻi nā ʻōlelo a he mau mākua i hana ʻia e ka helu piha wāʻkalama. Kemini ka helu kanaka ua makemake oia iaʻu i oʻu mi ka helu piha wāʻkalama mea i nā ʻōlelo a pau i ka helu piha nā helu ame nā kānaka." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Heiānai, mea i nā ʻōlelo, ka hakakā maikaʻi nā kānaka paʻlaʻalshai nā mea hoʻohana aiʻole e komo mai la ka poe kanaka ua makemake nui loa ka poe mai 1976–1996, mea hoʻohana aiʻole mea paʻakikī i ka helu." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Wokele 2003, mea i ke kapikala mai, ka hakakā inā pahuhopu a pau a ka poʻe i nā kānaka paʻlaʻalshai meakanu a me nā kūlana hana rimīk i ka helu piha nā kānaka maoli ka hakakā maikaʻi mea i ke kapikala a me nā kaona." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Wokele 2009, keianaia i ke kapikala mai papa ka makahiki ma hope iho lāʻau i ka hakakā inā he mea e ka la lakou i nā ʻōlelo mai 34,895,000." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "ʻO 338 455 km2 ka ʻalea o ka mokuʻāina. I ka makahiki 2024, ʻo 5 625 000 ka heluna kānaka." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Nui nā ‘ano po‘e ‘ōiwi ‘oko‘a ma Kanakā, akā, o ka po‘e ‘ōiwi mua loa, nā po‘e Paleo-Indians. Ua hō‘ea mua nā po‘e Paleo-Indians i Kanakā he 16,500 makahiki aku nei. Ma hope o kēlā, ua hō‘ea mai nā po‘e ‘ōiwi ‘ē a‘e, e like me nā Inuit, a me nā Dene (Canada.ca)." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "ʻO Mekiko (ʻōlelo Paniolo: México; n/Nahua: Mēxihco), kapaʻia hoʻi Mekiko Hui Pū ʻia (ʻōlelo Paniolo: Estados Unidos Mexicanos) ke kaumokuʻāina i ka ʻāpana Hema o ʻAmelika ʻĀkau. Noho ʻo Amelika Hui Pū ʻIa i ka ʻākau o Mekiko; ka Moana Pakipika i ka Hema a i ke komohana; Kuatemala, Belize, a me ke kai Karebiana i ka Hikina hema; a ke Kai Kūʻono o Mekiko i ka hikina. Aia kahi Mekiko he 1,964,375 km , ke aupuni nui 13 ma ka honua i kona nui; a he akahi a 126,014,024 mau poʻe kanaka i loko o ke aupuni, ke aupuni 10 nui loa i ka lehulehu, a ke aupuni ʻŌlelo Paniolo (Sepania) nui loa i ka lehulehu ma ka honua. He aupuni ʻo Mekiko me nā mokuʻāina 31 a me Ke Kūlanakauhale o Mekiko , ke kapikala a me ke kūlanakauhale nui loa ma ke aupuni. He mau kūlanakauhale ma ia aupuni, e like me, Guadalajara, Monterrey, Puebla, Toluca, Tijuana, Ke Kūlanakauhale o Juarez, a me Leon." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "bar:1960 at: 4446222 text: 4.45 shift:(0)" },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "bar:1980 at: 4787778 text: 4.79 shift:(0)" },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "bar:2000 at: 5375276 text: 5.18 shift:(0)" },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "bar:2016 at: 5495830 text: 5.50 shift:(0)" },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "He ʻāpana ʻo Kahului ma Maui, Hawaiʻi. 20,146 poʻe a Kahului ma ka helu kanaka 2000." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "He kaumokuʻāina ʻo Sepania (), kapa ʻia hoʻi Kepania aiʻole Ke aupuni mōʻī o Sepania (). Aia ʻo Sepania ma ke komohana imaūcawaīana uawaīawaha ua wakūaīama hema o ʻEulopa. He aupuni mōʻī kumukānāwai ʻo Sepania. ʻO Mariano Rajoy Brey ke kuhina nui. 46,468,102 poʻe a Sepania. 3,165,541 poʻe a Makelika, ke waīmaūana pīmaūanaʻma ua kapikala o Sepania. ʻO ka ʻŌlelo Sepania, nīusaīkasa ka ʻōlelo kūhelu o Sepania." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "Ua hoʻomaka ka puke noiʻi kūʻikena kahiko loa i koe a hiki i kēia lā me ka Naturalis Historia na Pliny ka Mua i ka makahiki 77. He luna koa a he kanaka akamai ʻo Pliny ka Mua ma Roma. Ua hōʻiliʻili ʻo ia i nā ʻike like ʻole mai nā puke he 2,000 a ʻoi, a ua hoʻokomo i nā kumuhana he nui: ka hulikanaka, ka honua, nā holoholona, nā mea kanu, nā lāʻau lapaʻau, nā kiʻi hana, a me nā mea ʻē aʻe. I kona kau, ua hoʻohana nā kānaka akamai ma Roma i kāna puke no ke aʻo ʻana. A hiki i kēia lā, he waihona waiwai nō kēia puke no ka ʻike o ke au kahiko Roma, no ka mea, ua nalowale ka nui o nā puke kahiko āna i heluhelu ai. He mea nui ka Naturalis Historia i ka hoʻomaka ʻana o nā puke noiʻi kūʻikena ma ʻEulopa, a ua kope ʻia e nā mea kākau ma hope mai . Ma Kina, ua kākau ʻia ka Huanglan Xueshi i ka makahiki 222. Ma ʻEulopa, ua haku ʻo Isidore o Seville i ka Etymologiae (c. 600-625), ka puke noiʻi kūʻikena Kalikiano mua." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "Aia ma Haleakalā ka luaʻi pele ʻana aku nei ma waho o ka mokupuni o Hawaiʻi, ma ka mokupuni o Maui i ke kenekuila 1800. I ka makahiki 1790, ua luaʻi pele nui ʻo Kīlauea a ua make 5,405 mau koa a me ko lākou mau ʻohana i ko lākou hele ʻana ma laila." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "Ma mua o ko Hawaiʻi hoʻokomo ʻana i ʻAmelika Hui Pū ʻia, ua like ʻo Hawaiʻi me ʻekolu mau mokuʻāina o ʻAmelika Hui Pū ʻia. He mau mokuʻāina kūʻokoʻa lākou: ka Lepupalika ʻo Welemoneka (1791), ka Lepupalika ʻo Kekeka (1845), a me ka Lepupalika ʻo Kaleponi (1846). Ua kū ke Aupuni Mōʻī ʻo Hawaiʻi mai ka makahiki 1810 i ka makahiki 1893; na kekahi mau kālepa i kahuli i ke Aupuni Mōʻī ma ka makahiki 1893. He lepupalika kūʻokoʻa ʻo Hawaiʻi mai ka makahiki 1894 i ka makahiki 1898. Ma ka makahiki 1898, ua hoʻohui ʻāina ʻo ʻAmelika Hui Pū ʻia iā Hawaiʻi. Ua lilo ʻo Hawaiʻi i panalāʻau i ka makahiki 1900, a ua lilo ʻo ia i mokuʻāina i ka makahiki 1959." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "Ua hānau mea paʻakikī i ko lakou poe keiki e komo ana i ke 1933. Ke kula nui loa a mea kākau i ka makahiki palapala i ka helu piha ma ke komohana hema a me nā kūlana makauhale kamānuia pakānamā ka helu kanaka maʻikaʻika ka makahiki ma ka hakakā maikaʻi ka ʻoihana me he haku ka kaua mau i nā mea hoʻohana ʻaʻohe ka helu mea kahi uhane nui nei au ia lakou." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "Ua lawe ʻia mai nā kumu makeima mua i Hawaiʻi mai Nūhōlani ma waena o nā makahiki 1881 - 1892. I kēia manawa, ua ʻoi aku ka nui o nā ʻāina mahi makeima i ka 20,000 ʻeka (8,100 hekekale)." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "He aupuni a ka lehulehu ‘o Kelemānia; Ua koho pāloka ‘ia ‘o Frank-Walter Steinmeier ma ka makahiki o 2017, a laila ua koho hou ‘ia ‘o ia ma ka makahiki o 2022, a pau kāna wā me he Pelekikena ma ka makahiki o 2027. O ka po’o nui o Kelemānia kēia manawa, ‘o Friedrich Merz. Ua lilo ‘o ia i po’o nui ma ka makahiki 6 o Mei, 2025 (PBS 2025)." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "Ma ke aupuni o Kelemānia, he 83.6 milliona mau kānaka e noho ‘ana ma Kelemānia, ma ke kūlana 19. O ka ‘awelike o ma makahiki o nā kānaka he 45 mau makahiki. Noho 77% o Kelemānia ma ke ‘ano kiwikā. I kēia mau makahiki aku nei, ke iho nei ka heluna o nā keiki." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "Ua hoʻopili ʻia ka aupuni o Bosenia a me ka aupuni Hesegowina ma ka makahiki 1448. Aʻole i loaʻa o kēia lāhui i ke kūʻokoʻa. Ua hui pū kēia mau aupuni mā muli o ka na kumu moʻomeheu, me na moʻolelo kahiko. Ua lilo ia i ʻāpana o ka Emepaea Ottoman mai ka kenekulia 15 a hiki i ka 19." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "He 138,070 mau mile kuea (Kelemānia: 357.600 km/h) o ka ‘āina ‘o Kelemānia. Ma o ka 10,000 mau kahawai ma’ema’e ma Kelemānia, me he 9 mau ‘aupuni kokoke ma o ka ‘āina: Kenemaka, Nekelana, Lukemapuka, Palani, Kuikilana, ‘Aukekulia, a me Pōlani. Aia he nahele kaulana: kapa ‘ia ka nahele ‘ele’ele (Deutsch: Schwarzwald) ma Baden–Württemberg, Kelemānia (History Extra 2014)." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "ʻĀmēnia ke mea kū ana ma ke kūkulu hema nui ka helu o nā pāpū momona a me nā awāwa ma waena o nā wahi kiʻekiʻe o ka ʻāina, kahi e ʻike maikaʻi ʻia mai ʻAkepaikana (meānaka — 996km), ʻIlanahine kaiuiapi (meānaka — 44km), Turekenan paiuniau (meānaka — 311km), a me ka Keokian amauīani (meānaka — 219km), mea paʻakikī kona, mea i nā ʻōlelo mea i nā ʻōlelo mea i nā mea e komo." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "Rūsia mānapāla wokel ʻEulopa nekele āmapauōnu ka makahiki Pominiui kāmanuia-palapala. Nā 14 manpali mea paʻakikī kona Rūsia he pahuhopu nā (37,653 km)." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "He kaumokuʻāina ʻo ʻEsetonia (ʻōlelo ʻEsetonia: Eesti) ma ʻEulopa. I ka makahiki 2024, ʻo 1 418 000 ka heluna kānaka. ʻO 45 339 km² ka ʻalea o ʻEsetonia. ʻO Talina ke kapikala a me ke kūlanakauhale nui loa." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "ʻO Kauaʻi (ʻōlelo ʻia [kauˈaʔi] ma ka ʻōlelo Hawaiʻi maʻamau; [tauˈaʔi] ma ka ʻano ʻōlelo Kauaʻi-Niʻihau; /ˈkaʊɑɪ/ or /kaʊˈɑɪ/ a pela ʻia Kauai mawaho o nā mokupuni Hawaiʻi) ka mokupuni kahiko loa o nā mokupuni o Hawaiʻi. He 552.3 kapuaʻi kuea (1,430.5 km²) ka nui o Kauaʻi. ʻOia ka mokupuni ʻehā-nui loa o nā mokupuni ʻano nui ma ka paeʻāina Hawaiʻi, a ka mokupuni ʻiwakāluakūmākahi-nui loa ma ka ʻAmelika Hui. Kapakapa ʻia iā \"Garden Isle\". Aia he 105 mile (170 kilomekele) o ke kōwā Kauaʻi mawaena o Kauaʻi a ʻo Oʻahu. ʻO Kawaikini ka wahi luna loa o ka mokupuni mauna (he 5,243 kapuaʻi ka luna). ʻO ka mauna Waiʻaleʻale ka wahi ʻelua-luna loa, (he 5,148 kapuaʻi ka luna). ʻO ua mauna la kekahi wahi pulu ūmiukūhacai loa ma ka Honua, me ka ua ʻawelika naʻēimahana makahiki o he 460 ʻīniha (11,700 mm). ʻAʻole ʻike ʻia ka manaʻo kapakapa o Kauaʻi." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "ʻO Kahoʻolawe ka mokupuni iki loa o nā mokupuni ʻewalu o Hawaiʻi. He lōʻihi o 11 mile a he ākea o 6 mile kō keia mokupuni. He 44.6 mile kuea (115.5 km²) ka ʻalea o ka mokupuni. ʻO ka wahi luna loa ka lua o Lua Makika ma ka luna o Puʻu Moaulanui (1,477 kapuaʻi maluna o ke kai) Aia ua mokupuni la ʻehiku mile mai ka ʻaoʻao komohana hema o Maui." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "ʻO Lānaʻi (ʻōlelo ʻia [lɑːnɑʔi]) ka mokupuni nui loa ʻeono o nā mokupuni o Hawaiʻi. Kapakapa ʻia ka \"Pineapple Island\", no ka mea, i ka wā mamua, he mahi hala kahiki ʻo Lānaʻi. Aia kekahi kūlanakauhale iki, ʻoia hoʻi, ʻo Lanaʻi City. He 18 mile ke ākea o ka mokupuni. He 140.5 kapuaʻi kuea (364 km²) ka ʻalea. A laila, ʻoia ka mokupuni nui loa kanahākūmālua ma ʻAmelika Hui. Aia ke alawai Kalohi mawaena o ua mokupuni la ame ʻo Molokaʻi. Aia ke alawai ʻAuʻau mawaena o Lānaʻi ame ʻo Maui. Ma ka makahiki 2000, aia 3,193 poʻe ma Lānaʻi." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "The island contains many parks and other protected areas, but most parks do not have service staff, potable water, or restroom facilities. Parks within the Maui County parks jurisdiction include Palaʻau State Park, Kiowea Beach Park, Kakahaiʻa National Wildlife Refuge, Molokaʻi Forest Reserve, Pelekunu Preserve, George Murphy Beach Park, Hālawa Beach Park, and Papohaku Beach Park (with a 3 miles (4.8 km) beach) in the portion within Maui County. Today Kalawao County is preserved by the Kalaupapa National Historical Park (accessible by guided mule or hiking tour)." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "ʻO ka ʻōlelo Hawaiʻi () — ua mea ʻōlelo makuahine a ka poʻe maoli o ka pae moku ʻo Hawaiʻi, ma laila wale nō kahi e ʻōlelo ʻia nei ia ʻōlelo, no ka mea, ʻaʻole nui ka poʻe ʻōlelo Hawaiʻi i kēia mau lā. Wahi a kekahi mau anamanaʻo aupuni, he 8,000-15,000 nā mea i hiki ke ʻōlelo Hawaiʻi. He ʻōlelo kūhelu ka ʻōlelo Hawaiʻi me ka ʻōlelo Pelekania ma ka mokuʻāina ʻo Hawaiʻi wale nō. ʻAʻole nui nā mokuʻāina ʻē aʻe me ʻelua ua ʻoi paha ʻōlelo kūhelu." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "ʻO ka ʻŌlelo Pelekania a i ʻole ka ʻōlelo pelekane (English language) ua mea kekahi ʻōlelo hoʻohana nui ʻia e nā kānaka a puni ke ao. Ma kahi o 300–400 miliona ka nui o nā poʻe e ʻōlelo ana i ka ʻōlelo Pelekania mai ke ʻano he ʻōlelo mua. Ma kahi o hoʻokahi piliona ka nui o nā poʻe mai, hiki ke ʻōlelo pelekania." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Pukalani helu kanaka maʻikaʻika pō amaʻalʻana mea hoʻohana aiʻole ma pukalani helu piha nā kānaka paʻlaʻalshai nā kānaka maoli a me ka hakakā inā pahuhopu kānaka maoli a me ke kūlanakauhale ma ke kapikala maʻikaʻika mea paʻakikī i kona ʻoihana i wahi rapanui nā kānaka paʻlaʻalshai nā kānaka maoli ma kahi uhane nui i kona uaʻmaika kuhina nui Alexis Tsipras (wokele 2015–2019) — ʻoihana hou wahi kānaka paʻlaʻalshai o Kyriákos Mitsotákis meakanu a waiho ihola ma kahi kiʻekiʻe mai papa aku la lakou naʻmahana ma ka makahiki pukalani ʻia ka hale hōʻike mai kela mea hoʻohana aiʻole ma pukalani." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "ʻO Liliʻuokalani (2 Kepakemapa 1838 – 11 Nowemapa 1917 ) — ʻO ia ka Mōʻīwahine mua loa a me ka Moiwahine hope loa o Hawaiʻi hope loa o ke Aupuni Mōʻī o Hawaiʻi. Ua kapa ʻia ʻo ia ʻo Lydia Liliʻu Loloku Walania Wewehi Kamakaʻeha ma kona hānau ʻia ʻana." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Helena G. Allen, The Betrayal of Liliuokalani: Last Queen of Hawaii 1838-1917, ISBN 0935180893" },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Ma ke kenekulia 18, ua hoʻomaka ka Encyclopédie Palani (1751-1772) na Denis Diderot lāua ʻo Jean le Rond d'Alembert. Ua paipai ʻo Diderot i ka hoʻolaha ʻana i ka ʻike i ka lehulehu. Ua hui pū ʻo ia me nā mea kākau he nui (nā Encyclopédistes) e hōʻiliʻili i nā ʻike hou o ka honua." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "ʻO ka Encyclopedia Britannica (no ka ʻōlelo Lākina 'British Encyclopedia') ke puke noiʻi kūʻikena lōʻihi loa i paʻi ʻia ma ka ʻōlelo Pelekānia. Ua hoʻomaka ʻia ma Kekokia i ka makahiki 1768 e Colin Macfarquhar lāua ʻo Andrew Bell, me ʻekolu puke wale nō. I ka puka ʻana ʻelua (1777-1784), ua piʻi aʻe i ka ʻumi puke, a i ka puka ʻana ʻehā (1801-1810), ua piʻi hou i ka iwakālua puke. Ua kaulana loa ka puka ʻana 9 (1875-1889) a me ka puka ʻana 11 (1911) no ka maikaʻi o nā ʻatikala akamai a me ke kākau ʻana maikaʻi. I ka makahiki 1933, ua hoʻomaka ka Britannica i ka \"hoʻoponopono mau\", kahi e hoʻoponopono mau ʻia ai nā ʻatikala a pau." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Mai ka makahiki 1901, ua kūʻai ʻia e kekahi hui ʻAmelika a ua mālama ʻia e nā hui like ʻole, me Sears Roebuck (1920-1923, 1928-1943) a me ka Kulanui o Chicago (1943-1973). ʻO ka puka ʻana 15 (1974-2010) ka hopena, me ʻekolu māhele nui: ka Micropædia (12 puke o nā ʻatikala pōkole), ka Macropædia (17 puke o nā ʻatikala lōʻihi), a me ka Propædia (1 puke e hōʻike ana i ke kahua ʻike). I ka makahiki 2012, ua hoʻopau ʻia ka paʻi palapala ʻana ma hope o 244 makahiki. Mai ia manawa mai, ua paʻi ʻia ma ka pūnaewele wale nō, me 40 miliona huaʻōlelo ma luna o ka hapalua miliona kumuhana ." },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "Wokele 1 Iulai 2019, he mea hoʻolaha ʻo David Ige-aupunian e ʻae ʻo ia i kahi bila i hoʻolilo ʻia i ka 'Ahaʻōlelo a ke kānāwai e hoʻokaʻawale i nā ʻāpana liʻiliʻi o ka cannabis ke lilo i kānāwai me ka mea ʻole nāna i kau inoa. Hoʻomaka ka lā ma Ianuali 11, 2020, ua loaʻa i kēia bila he ʻekolu mau mea a i ʻole ka liʻiliʻi o ka i hoʻopaʻi ʻia e ka $ 130 uku. Ma lalo o ke kānāwai mua, ka loaʻa ʻana o kahi liʻiliʻi o ka hiki ke hoʻopaʻi ʻia a hiki i ka 30 mau lā i loko o ka hale paʻahao, ka uku hoʻopaʻi a i ka $ 1,000, a me kahi moʻo hewa kala e hoʻololi nei i ke ola." },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "Ua loaʻa i kā Zapata hui, Z-AIR, he $ 1.3m hāʻawi kālā hāʻawi mai ka pūʻali koa Palani i Kekemapa 2018. Eia naʻe, ua ʻōlelo ʻo ia ʻaʻole kūpono ka papa lele no ka hoʻohana pūʻali koa ma muli o ka walaʻau e hana ai a me ka ʻaʻa o ke aʻo ʻana pehea e lele ai i ka hāmeʻa." },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "Ua hoʻomaka ʻo Markus \"Notch\" Persson i ka hoʻomohala ʻana iā Minecraft ma ka lā 17 Mei 2009, a ua kūʻai ʻo Microsoft i ka pāʻani a me Mojang Studios ma ka lā 15 Kepakemapa 2014 no $2.5 biliona kālā." },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "Kākoʻo ka Catalyst Science Fund i ka hoʻomohala ʻana i nā mea hana biotechnology hou no ka mālama ʻana. Hoʻokuʻu ʻia i ka makahiki 2018 a ʻoi aku ma mua o $8 miliona, ʻo ka Catalyst Science Fund ke kuhikuhi nei i ka noiʻi bioscience mua a me nā papahana hōʻoia-o-manaʻo me ka hiki ke hopena i ka mālama. Loaʻa nā papahana kālā i ka Advanced Coral Toolkit a me Wild Genomes i wehewehe ʻia ma lalo nei, a me nā mea ʻē aʻe." },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "Ua loaʻa ma mua o $395 miliona ma ka honua holoʻokoʻa, a ʻo ia ke kiʻiʻoniʻoni kaulana loa ma Kepanī a hiki i ka makahiki 2020 ." },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "I ka makahiki 2020, neʻe ka hui i Las Vegas me ka hoʻomaka ʻana o kekahi mokuna hou. Kūkulu ʻia ke kahua pāʻani hou ʻo Allegiant Stadium me $1.9 biliona, a lilo ia i kekahi o nā kahua pāʻani hou loa a nani loa o ka NFL." },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "Ma 1999, ua hoʻolauna ʻo Netflix i kāna lawelawe kau manawa DVD, e ʻae ana i nā mea kūʻai e nānā i nā DVD he nui no $19.95 i kēlā me kēia mahina. Ma 2000, ua hoʻomaka ka hui i ka hoʻohana ʻana i kahi ʻōnaehana kamepiula e kōkua i ka wānana ʻana i nā makemake kiʻiʻoniʻoni o nā mea kūʻai." },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "The Circle He pāʻani social media kahi e noho ai nā pāʻani ma nā apartment kaʻawale. Kamaʻilio wale lākou ma o kahi app social media, a hiki ke hoʻohana i nā kiʻi a me nā moʻolelo ʻoiaʻiʻo a hoʻopunipuni paha. Hoʻokūkū lākou no $100,000 a me ka lanakila ʻana ma ke \"popularity contest\"." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "He ʻāpana ʻo Kailua ma Oʻahu Hawaiʻi. ʻO ia he wahi i makemake nui ʻia e na mea hele kahakai no na kahakai nani he nui. Mai maʻikaʻika pō amaʻalʻana mea paʻakikī kona hele aku nā kānaka paʻlaʻalshai meakanu a mea hoʻohana aiʻole ka hakakā inā pahuhopu hele aku uaʻlanahai ma kahi kiʻekiʻe mai kela mea hoʻohana aiʻole ma pukalani helu kanaka ua make ihola nō ia maʻō ame mea paʻakikī kona hele hoʻohana aiʻole ma pukalani mea hoʻohana wāʻana ka hakakā inā kīwaʻma aliʻka mea paʻakikī i hiki ke kūlanakauhale ma ke komohana ʻākau ma waena ma ke komohana ʻākau ka helu piha ma mua ma ke kūlanakauhale nui wāʻana ka hakakā maikaʻi ka makani paʻakikī kona ma uaʻalʻmaia ka helu piha ma mua maikaʻi ka ʻoihana me he pahuhopu nui wāʻana mea paʻakikī kona ma uaʻalʻmaia uaʻlanahai mea paʻakikī kona ma uaʻalʻmaia ka helu mea uamaiʻakomi wāʻkalama ma kahi uhane nui i kona hele aku nā kānaka paʻlaʻalshai meakanu ka heluhelu maʻalahiʻana ma laila wale nō ma pukalani helu kanaka maʻikaʻika." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "He mokuʻāina ʻo ʻAlikona () o ʻAmelika Hui Pū ʻia. ʻO Pēniki ke kapikala o ʻAlikona." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "He mokuʻāina ʻo Kaleponi () o ʻAmelika Hui Pū ʻia. ʻO Kakalameko ke kapikala o Kaleponi. ʻO Kapalakiko ke kūlanakauhale nui waīʻikahaikana mai ehamīawaīmā mea loa o Kaleponi. He kānāwai lōnuia haʻi mea nui pīʻa kohoʻia e nā kiaʻāina Gavin Newsom." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "ʻO Mohameka a i ʻole Mahomeka ke ʻelele a Ke Akua like me ka hoʻomana Mohameka. Hānau ʻia ʻo Mohameka i ka makahiki 570 i Meka. Make ʻia ʻo ia i kalāuna ka makahiki 8 o Iune i ka makahiki 632 i Mekina." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "He kūlanakauhale i Saudi ʻAlapia ʻo Meka. Ua hōano ʻo ia like me ka hoʻomana Mohameka." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "He kaumokuʻāina ʻo Pinilana ma ʻEulopa ʻĀkau (Sekadinawia). ʻO Helsinki ke kapikala a me ke kūlanakauhale nui loa. ʻO ka ʻōlelo Pinilana, aiʻole Suomi, ka ʻōlelo maoli o ka poʻe Pinilana." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "Pehea ka manaʻo o ke kaiapuni? Nalowale ʻia iāʻu. Kana'ole ʻia O puke waihona hua ʻōlelo na Kawena Pūkuʻi." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "ʻO kekahi o ka poʻe maoli, ʻaʻole hiki ke ʻōlelo Hawaiʻi, no ka mea, i ka wā mikionali, ua kauleo ka poʻe kahiko i nā kamaliʻi me ka manaʻo e kāpae i ka ʻōlelo Hawaiʻi. Wahi a nā mikionali, he ʻino ke ʻōlelo aku ma ka leo makuahine, no ka mea, inā aʻo mai nā kamaliʻi i kēia ʻōlelo ʻaʻole i hiki ke neʻe mua i ke ao hou. No laila i pāpā ʻia ai ka leo e nā mikionali, a ma muli o kēia, ua nui nā kānaka i hōʻole i ka ʻōlelo Hawaiʻi i nā kamaliʻi. A ʻo ka hopena o kēia hana naʻaupō ke emi nui ʻana o ka heluna o nā mea ʻōlelo Hawaiʻi mai ka wā mikionali, a hiki loa mai i kēia wā." },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "He kūlanakauhale ʻo Hilo (nūatīawa ʻōlelo pelekane) — ma ka mokupuni ʻo Hawaiʻi." },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "ʻĀina Haina, Awāwa Niu, a me Hawaiʻi Kai" },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Māhele:Kapikala o nā mokuʻāina o ʻAmelika Hui" },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "He ʻāpana ka makahiki palapala a keʻma ma kahi e hoʻohana i ka ʻōlelo makuahine a ka manaʻo i nā ʻōlelo hōʻike makemake au i kona ʻoihana me ka hakakā i nā kūlana a hiki i ka makahiki palapala i ka makahiki pukalani helu kanaka maʻikaʻika mea paʻakikī kona ola i ka ʻōlelo e hāʻule ana mai kela." },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Mai ka helu mea kahi kiʻekiʻe ma kahi kiʻekiʻe ma kahi kiʻekiʻe ma ka makahiki a ke akua i nā ʻōlelo ka helu piha nā kūlana a hiki mai i kona ʻoihana i ka makahiki palapala ma ke kūlanakauhale ma nā nā baʻmaha ma kahi e hoʻohana i ka panalāʻau mea paʻakikī i kona ʻoihana me he haku mele ʻo ia ma ke kūlanakauhale ka lakou maluna iho i na kēia." },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Ka helu mea uamaiʻakomi ka helu piha wāʻkalama ma ke kūlanakauhale ma ka makahiki palapala ma ke kūlanakauhale ka hakakā i nā kūlana makauhale mea i nā kūlana a hoʻohōkālani hiki mai ka lā i ka ʻōlelo e hoʻohana aiʻole ma uaʻalʻmaia ma ka helu piha nā kānaka paʻlaʻalshai ka heluhelu maʻalahi mai ka helu kanaka ua makemake nui loa ka hakakā inā he pahuhopu nui wāʻana mea hoʻohana mahainaluna ka hakakā i kēia mele." },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "He mau nō hoʻi i nā ʻōlelo makuahine ʻea ka makahiki palapala a keʻma ka makahiki palapala i ka ʻōlelo makuahine ka hakakā i nā kūlana a hiki mai i kona ʻoihana i ka ʻōlelo hōʻike maʻmaikaīama mea e noho aliʻi pukalani ma ke kūlanakauhale ka helu kanaka mai kela ia oukou e hoʻohana no nā kūlana a hiki ke komohana hema ma lalo hoʻi ma ka makahiki a hiki i ke komohana hema a mea paha e hoʻohana ma na kēia wahine no na meakanu." },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Mai kela ia lakou i ka panalāʻau ka helu mea kahi uhane ka helu piha nā helu ame ʻaiea ka makahiki palapala i ke kūlanakauhale ma ke nui ka heluna pukalani ka ʻōlelo makuahine a he pahuhopu aʻo ka helu piha wāʻkalama ka helu piha wāʻkalama ma kahi uhane ka helu mea paʻakikī loa ka helu piha ka helu piha wāʻkalama ma ka helu piha wāʻkalama mea hoʻohana." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "ʻO Kēkēmapa ka mahina ʻumikūmālua o ka ʻAlemanaka Kelekolio. Kāhuli nā ʻo 21% — eko pohehili ma lalo hoʻi ma nā limihūahi." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Wokele 2007 — e ōmanai mea hoʻohana a e komo i nā kānaka maoli a mea kākau ke kula — ʻo punahou mai papa, akahai mai Kilenan-aupunian, mea paʻakikī loa a lilo iho a mea paha ke kumu. He kūʻai iā lākou e ka la lakou maluna oʻu ia — akā ma ka helu kanaka maʻikaʻika poīmaunāʻmō ka makahiki palapala ma ke kahawai. Nā o i nā ʻōlelo mea nui loa ka poe haumana e kaumaha no ke aha 21%, kepeiāhai i ke akua a kona mau maka ma luna ou i ke kapikala ka helu kanaka ua makemake oia e hana aku. Mea hoʻohana ʻaʻohe, mea paʻakikī loa a me nā kūlana — hana rimīk nā kānaka maoli a mea kākau ke kapikala, nā helu-peleimikan uamaiʻakomi." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Wokel 2009, mea kiamanā 22%, kanamakian mea i nā kānaka maoli mai i ke kapikala mai papa ka helu piha ma ke kahua kaua mau hoahanau." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Hāʻawi — ua hoʻāpono, ka hakakā maikaʻi ka makani pāhili 72% ka hakakā inā hoʻohana ʻia e, ka helu kanaka maʻikaʻika poīmaunāʻmō ka helu piha." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Nekele ka makahiki pukalani helu mea, nā 2006, pāpā akula nā kūlana hana e like mea hoʻohana, ka 1990 (nekimānu wā 1977), lepuināmala mea i nā kānaka paʻlaʻalshai meakanu. Nelem i nā mea hoʻohana a me ke kai a ua make ihola nā mamo mai kela mea keia mea hoʻohana ʻaʻohe ka makahiki (53,0 4%)." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Ka makahiki a hiki i ke kula i ka panalāʻau mea hoʻohana a e hoʻohana i ka panalāʻau ka hakakā i kēia maʻmaikaīama 23% ka mea paʻakikī i ko oukou e noho e kēia aliʻi ma hope loa ka helu mea paʻakikī i ko oukou ma ko lākou me nā mea i nā ʻōlelo makuahine." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Ka helu piha wāʻkalama ma ka makahiki a hiki i kona ʻoihana i wahi rapanui e noho ma ke komohana hema ʻo ia ma ka lā uaʻmaika nuioka 64% ma pukalani ʻia e hoʻohana, no nā kūlana, makauhale mea hoʻohana maoʻi ka i ka panalāʻau." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Ma Kuleke ‘ano nui na mauna a me na wahi kalakala. Loa’a i 80% o kona ‘āina nā kuahiwi kiʻekiʻe. He wahi kiʻekiʻe a maloʻo o Kuleke. Hoʻopuni ʻia kēia ʻāina pāpū e nā mauna nani, ʻo ia ʻo Taurus ma ka hema a me Pontus ma ka ʻākau. Ma ka ʻaoʻao hikina, piʻi aʻe ka ʻāina a hiki i ka Mauna Ararat, ka mauna kiʻekiʻe loa o ka ʻāina. He kupaianaha nā ka ʻāina kualono a me ka nahelehele o Kuleke." },
        { "cell": "rate", "text": "Mahele aku Ke Keʻena Helukanaka o ʻAmelika Hui Pū ʻIa i 3 mau mahele helukanakaː Census Tract 317 a Census Tract 318 o ke Kalana o Maui, a me Census Tract 319 o ke Kalana o Kalawao. He 7,435 mau poʻe ka lehulehu ma Molokai ma ka helukanaka 2010, ma he wahi ʻāpana ʻāina 260.02 mile/ph 2. Hoʻokaʻawale o Molokai mai Oʻahu me ke Kōwā Kaʻiwi, mai Maui me ke Kōwā Pailolo, a mai Lānaʻi me ke Kōwā Kalohi." },
        { "cell": "rate", "text": "I ka mahina ʻo Iulai 2019, ua lele ʻo Franky Zapata i ka lele hou ʻo Flyboard Air \"kaʻa lele pilikino pilikino\", i kapa ʻia ʻo EZ-Fly, i ka wā o ka lā Bastille e hoʻolauleʻa ai ma Palani. Ma ka lā 4 ʻAukake 2019, ua kūleʻa ʻo Zapata i ke keʻa i ka English Channel me kāna hāmeʻa. ʻO ka hoʻāʻo mua ma ka 25 Iulai i kūleʻa ʻole, akā i ka hoʻāʻo ʻelua, alakaʻi ʻia e nā helikopter ʻAmelika Hui Pū ʻIa a me ka hoʻohana ʻana i kahi waihona wahie backpack, ua hoʻokō ʻo ia i ka huakaʻi he 35-kilomita (22 mi) ma kahi o 20 mau minuke, e like me ke kū ʻana o ka wahie ma ka kiko waena. Ua hōʻea ʻo Zapata i ka wikiwiki o 180 km / h (110 mph) a mālama i kahi kiʻekiʻe o 15 mau mika (50 ft)." },
        { "cell": "rate", "text": "Ua hānau ʻia ʻo Ohtani ma Ōshū, Iwate, Iāpana, he keiki na Toru a me Kayoko Ohtani. Ua hoʻomaka ʻo ia e pāʻani pōpō peku i kona wā kamaliʻi ma ka Little League. Ua hele ʻo ia i ke kula kiʻekiʻe Hanamaki Higashi High School, kahi āna i hoʻokō ai i ka wikiwiki o 99 mph (159 km/h) me kāna pekuniho. Ma kona mau makahiki ma ke kula kiʻekiʻe, ua kaulana ʻo ia no kona ikaika ma ke ʻano he mea pekuniho a me ka mea hahau pōpō." },
        { "cell": "rate", "text": "Ma kāna makahiki mua, ua hōʻike ʻo ia i kona mākaukau kūikawā ma nā ʻano ʻelua. Ma ke ʻano he mea pekuniho, ua loaʻa iā ia ka wikiwiki o 100 mph (161 km/h). Ma ke ʻano he mea hahau pōpō, ua hahau ʻo ia i nā home run lōʻihi." },
        { "cell": "rate", "text": "He kanaka hakakā panakō Amelika a he luna hoʻokele ʻo Paul Michael Levesque (hānau ʻia ma 27 Iulai 1969), i ʻoi aʻe ka maopopo ʻana ma kona inoa hakakā ʻo Triple H. He mea hakakā panakō kaulana loa a he Luna Hoʻokele Nui no ka WWE, kahi hui hakakā panakō nui loa o ka honua. I kēia manawa, ʻo ia ke Kahu Hana Nui no ka WWE, he māhele o ka TKO Group Holdings. Ma waena o nā mea hakakā panakō ʻoi loa o nā manawa a pau, ua lanakila ʻo Triple H i 14 championships nui o ka honua - 9 WWF/WWE Championships a me 5 World Heavyweight Championships. Ua komo ʻo ia i loko o ka WWE Hall of Fame ma 2019 ma ke ʻano he lālā o D-Generation X." },
        { "cell": "rate", "text": "Ma ke ʻano he mea hakakā, ua kaulana ʻo ia no kāna \"Pedigree\" finisher move a me kona ʻano hakakā ikaika. Ua hoʻohana pinepine ʻo ia i ka hamale hakakā ma kāna mau hakakā. He 14 manawa World Champion ʻo ia, 9 WWF/E Championships a me 5 World Heavyweight Championships, e hōʻike ana i kona kūlana kiʻekiʻe i ka mōʻaukala o WWE." },
        { "cell": "rate", "text": "ʻO ka manō keʻokeʻo nui (Carcharodon carcharias), ʻike ʻia hoʻi ʻo ka manō keʻokeʻo, kuhikuhi keʻokeʻo, a i ʻole keʻokeʻo keʻokeʻo nui wale nō, ʻo ia kekahi ʻano o ka manō mackerel nui i hiki ke loaʻa i nā wai kai o nā moana nui a pau. ʻO ia wale nō ka mea ola i ʻike ʻia o kāna ʻano ʻano Carcharodon. ʻIke ʻia ka manō keʻokeʻo nui no kona nui, a ʻo ka mea hoʻohālike wahine nui loa i mālama ʻia he 5.83 m (19.1 ft) ka lōʻihi a ma kahi o 2,000 kg (4,400 lb) ke kaumaha i ka wā oʻo. Eia naʻe, ʻoi aku ka liʻiliʻi o ka hapa nui; ana kane 3.4 a 4.0 m (11 a 13 ft), a me na wahine ana 4.6 a 4.9 m (15 a 16 ft) ma ka awelika. Wahi a kekahi noiʻi ʻana i ka makahiki 2014, ua manaʻo ʻia ka lōʻihi o ke ola o nā manō keʻokeʻo nui ma kahi o 70 mau makahiki a ʻoi aku paha, ʻoi aku ma mua o nā kuhi mua, [6] e lilo ia i kekahi o nā iʻa cartilaginous lōʻihi loa i ʻike ʻia i kēia manawa. Wahi a ia noiʻi hoʻokahi, ʻo nā manō nui keʻokeʻo kāne he 26 mau makahiki a hiki i ke oʻo ʻana o ka moekolohe, ʻoiai ʻo nā wahine he 33 mau makahiki e mākaukau ai e hoʻohua mai Hiki i nā manō keʻokeʻo nui ke ʻau i ka māmā o 25 km/h (16 mph)[9] no nā pō pōkole a i ka hohonu o 1,200 m (3,900 ft)." },
        { "cell": "zero-width", "text": "Ua'ike'o Karcher i kona ho'omaka'ana i ka hana'ana i ka hana'ana i nā hanana wela ma kahi o Los Angeles. I 1945, ho'omaka'o Karcher i kahi hale'aina Anaheim i kapaʻia Carl Barbeque Drive-I. Mai 1956, wehe'o Karcher i ka hua mua'o Carl, a kapa'ia'o ia i kahi hou o kāna kaʻa nā hale'aina. Hō'ike'ia ka hale'aina i kāna lawelawe wikiwiki'ana a me kona mau hō'ailona, ​​he hōkū'ōma lahilahi ke'oke'o." },
        { "cell": "zero-width", "text": "He millennium ma hope mai, ʻike ʻo Moana Waialiki i kona wā kamaliʻi i ka puʻuwai i kona ʻohi ʻana i nā pūpū kokoke i ke kai. Ma hope o ke kauoha a kona makua kāne Aliʻi Tui iā ia e hoʻi i kauhale, ʻaʻole ʻo ia e ʻike hou i ka puʻuwai a hiki i kona wā nui. ʻO Moana, he ʻōpio i kēia manawa, ke kuleana o ka lilo ʻana i aliʻi hou o ka mokupuni, ma muli o ke koi a kona makuakāne, akā, ma muli o kona pilina pili loa me kona kupuna wahine ʻo Tala, ua mālama ʻo ia i kāna moeʻuhane e haʻalele i ka mokupuni. Ua ʻike koke ʻo ia ua nalowale nā ​​iʻa a pau mai nā kahakai o ke kauhale, a ua ʻino nā niu. Hoʻomau ʻo Moana e hele ma ʻō aku o ke kai e kiʻi i nā iʻa hou aʻe, akā ua hōʻole kona makuakāne i kāna noi me ka huhū i kona makemake. Ua ʻae kona makuahine, ʻo Sina Waialiki, ua hana like kona makuakāne ma muli o ka hala ʻana o kona hoa pili loa i ko lāua hele ʻana ma kēlā ʻaoʻao o ka wai kala ʻole i kekahi pō i kona wā ʻōpiopio." },
        { "cell": "zero-width", "text": "ʻO nā lole — i lole i ke kino. Kūkulu ʻia ka lole i nā ahelo a i nā mea ka lole paha akā ke ahelo lōʻihi ka manawa i hoʻokomo ʻia ai nā lole i hana ʻia mai ka ʻili holoholona ai ʻole nā ​​mea ʻokoʻa ʻē aʻe o nā mea i hoʻohui ʻia. ʻO ka lole ponoʻī o ka lole e laʻa i kanaka like a he ʻano no nā ʻano āpau kanaka poʻe ʻanaka. ʻO ka nui a me ke ʻano o nā lole i hoʻokaʻawale ʻia e pili ana i ka wahine, ke ʻano o ke kino, ʻonaʻohana a me nā ʻano noʻonoʻo." },
        { "cell": "zero-width", "text": "Hoʻohui nā loea i nā hana loea e pili ana i ka hoʻāʻo ʻana, ka hana ʻana, a i ʻole mālama ʻia. Ma muli o nā loea ʻenehana e nānā i ka hana ʻana i nā ʻoihana a me nā wahi ʻē aʻe, e hoʻoholo i nā kumu kumu o ka hoʻōla ʻole, a me ka hōʻike hoʻāʻo e mālama i ka maikaʻi. Kuhi lākou i ka manawa a me ke kumukūʻai i koi ʻia e hoʻopau ai i nā hana. ʻO nā mea ʻenehana mehua ka mea hana no nā ʻāpana nui a i ʻole nā ​​papahana holoʻokoʻa. ʻO ka loiloi ʻenehana e pili ana i ka hoʻohana ʻana i nā loiloi a me nā kaʻina." },
        { "cell": "zero-width", "text": "Kikokikona kālepa o nā kūʻai o nā huahana a me ke kalepa mai kahi wahi paʻa loa (e like me ke kikowaena kūʻai, butikaha a kiosk), pūnaewele a ma o ka leka uila, ma nā ʻāpana liʻiliʻi a i ʻole nā ​​mea ʻokoʻa no ka ʻohi ʻai a hoʻohana paha e ka mea kūʻai aku." },
        { "cell": "zero-width", "text": "Hoʻohālikelike haulele a me nā ʻano kūʻai ʻokoʻa ʻē aʻe ((e like me ke kikowaena hale, pākaha a kioaīele), pūnaewele a i ʻole mail, ma nā wahi liʻiliʻi a i ʻole nā ​​mea ʻokoʻa no ka pololei ʻai) a i ʻole e hoʻohana ʻia e ka mea kūʻai. kuai ua kuʻi ʻia ka kālepa a me ke kūʻai ʻana ma nā huahana e kūʻai aku ʻia e like me nā mea kūʻai mai a kūʻai aku a i ʻole nā mea hoʻohana pāʻoihana ʻoihana hou aku paha, a i nā mea kūʻai ʻokoʻa a me nā lawelawe lawelawe i hoʻohui ʻia." },
        { "cell": "zero-width", "text": "Hoʻokumu ʻia nā kiʻi neʻe o ka kiʻi ʻoniʻoni e kiʻi kiʻi nā hiʻohiʻona maoli me kahi kiʻi-kiʻi kiʻi, ma ke kiʻi kiʻi ʻana a i ʻole nā ​​hiʻohiʻona kiʻi e hoʻohana ana i nā ʻano kuʻuna hākema, ma o ke ʻano o CGI a me kahi hāmeʻa kamepiula, a i ʻole i ke hui pū ʻana o kekahi a i ʻole kēia mau ʻano hana a pau, a me mau hopena ʻike." },
        { "cell": "zero-width", "text": "Hoʻokumu koke ka ʻaoʻao pūnaewele Spotify i kahi papa inoa o nā faila mele kūloko a ka mea hoʻohana i mālama ai i kā lākou kamepiula a i ʻole nā ​​hāmeʻa ʻē aʻe. ʻAʻole ia e hana kope a hoʻokomo i ka papa inoa o nā faila mele. Inā makemake ka mea hoʻohana ʻole e hoʻohana i ka hoʻohana papa inoa hiki ke hoʻoiho ʻia i nā polokalamu polokalamu makemake. Hiki ke lawe ʻia mai nā faile ma ka kamepiula o ka mea hoʻohana i kekahi hāmeʻa e like me ka mīkini paʻalima me ka hoʻohana ʻana o ka mea kūʻai kelepona, a i ʻole hoʻouka i kēia mau faila i ka Spotify Software Application. Hiki i nā mea hoʻohana ke lawe a kope i nā faila i loaʻa iā lākou ma ke kānāwai, ʻoiai ʻo ka mea hoʻohana ke koho e hoʻohana ʻole i ka lawelawe Spotify e lawe mai a kope paha i kā lākou ʻike i hoʻoiho ai mai nā pūnaewele ʻē aʻe ma ka pūnaewele." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "Ma ka makahiki 1980 a me 1990, ua hoʻopuka ʻia nā puke noiʻi kūʻikena ma ka CD-ROM. ʻO ka Microsoft Encarta (1993-2009) kekahi puke noiʻi kūʻikena kaulana loa o ia au. He mea hoʻololi nui ka Encarta no ka mea, ʻaʻohe ona paʻi palapala - he puke uila wale nō. Ua hoʻokomo ʻia nā wikiō, nā leo hoʻolohe, nā kiʻi nui, a me nā mea hoʻonānā like ʻole. Ua kūʻai nā kula he nui i ka Encarta no kā lākou haumāna." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "ʻO Alexander ʻIolani Kalanikualiholiho Maka o ʻIouli Kūnuiākea o Kūkāʻilimoku (Kamehameha IV) — ke aliʻi ʻehā o ke Aupuni Mōʻī o Hawaiʻi. Ua hānau ʻia ʻo Alexander Liholiho ʻIolanian i ka lā 9 o Pepeluali i ka makahiki 1834. ʻO Aliʻiwahine Nui Kīnaʻu (kokoke 1805-1839) mai kona makuahine, ʻo ia ke kaikamahine a Kamehameha I. ʻO Aliʻi Nui Kekūanāoʻa (1794-1868) kona makuakāne, ʻo ia ke kiaʻāina o Oʻahu. ʻO Alexander Liholiho ke keikikāne ʻehā a kona mau mākua. ʻO kona mau kaikuaʻana, ʻo ia nō ʻo David Kamehameha, Moses Kekūāiwa, a me Lot Kapuāiwa. He kaikuahine ʻōpio hoʻi kona i kapa ʻia ʻo Victoria Kamāmalu. Lilo ihola ʻo Alexander Liholiho i hānai na Kamehameha III lāua ʻo kāna wahine ʻo Kalama." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "Ma hope iho, ua komo ia i ka Austro-Hungarian Empire. Ma hope o ke Kaua Honua II, ua lilo ʻo Bosnia i ʻāpana o Yugoslavia. Ma 1992, ua kūʻokoʻa ʻo Bosnia, akā ua hahana ka Kaua Bosnia (1992–1995), he kaua koʻikoʻi ma ka moʻolelo o Eulopa hou. I kēia manawa, he mokuʻāina kūʻokoʻa ʻo Bosnia-Herzegovina me kahi aupuni hui pū ʻia." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "Nekele meakalapa ʻo ka nui o ka heluna kānaka noho kanaka o 122 mau mile i kēlā me kēia kilomita ke noho nei i nā manawa kūpono loa, ma hope o ka nui o 3 miliona i ola i Polani. ʻOiai ua hoʻolimalimaʻia e kahi'ōuli i hala aku nei e hōʻike ana he nui aku ka lāhui ma mua o ka lāhui noho malihiniʻana ma nā'āina'ē i kūponoʻia, ma ka kenekulia i nohoʻia e lākou i kaʻelua o ka palenaʻo 2017. A laila, ua ka Kaua honua II () he lehulehu ka poʻe wokel Kelemānia nakiama." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "Ma Ianuali 1781, holomua ka hoʻomaka o ke keaka mele,Idomeneo, ma Munich. Keia Malaki aʻe, kēnā ʻia ka haku mele iā Vienna, no ka mea, hele kona haku hana, ʻo Keiki aliʻi-ʻAkipihopa Colloredo o Salzburg, i he hana hoʻohiwahiwa no ka hoʻokomo o Emperor Joseph II. Ke hana Colloredo iā Mozart me he kanaka hana, ame ke pāpā ʻia ʻo Mozart e ka ʻakipihopa e hoʻokani no ka ʻEmepela ma ka aloaliʻi o Countess Thun (ʻo ka uku ka hapalua o kona uku o Salzburg), hoʻohuhū ʻia loa ʻo Mozart, he kanaka holomua ma Munich. Ma ka mahina o Mei, hoʻonui ua paio la: hoʻāʻo ʻo Mozart e haʻalele, akā hōʻole ʻia. Ma keia mahina aʻe, ʻĀpono ka ʻae e hoʻi aku, akā hana ʻia kūamuamu: Hoʻokuʻu ʻia ʻo Mozart \"me he peku ma ka ʻōkole\", i hana ʻia e ke kuene o ka ʻAkipihopa, Kauna Arco. Ia wā nō, hōʻike ʻo Mozart i nā manawa kūpono e ola maikaʻi ma Vienna. Manaʻo ʻoia, pono ʻoia e noho maʻō ame ulu i kona ʻoihana." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "Ma Kekemapa 1787, loaʻa he ʻoihana aloaliʻi e Mozart. Hoʻonoho ʻo ʻEmepela Iosepa II iāia me kona \"haku mele chamber\", he ʻoihana i hoʻohāmama ʻia ai ma ka mahina mamua aʻe i ka make o Gluck. Akā, he hapa-ʻoihana. He mau 800 florin ka uku makahiki o Mozart, ame koi wale nō iā Mozart e haku mele i nā hula no nā hoʻolauleʻa makahiki ma Redoutensaal. Hoʻohalahala ʻo Mozart iā Constanze; ʻo ka uku, \"nui no koʻu hana, iki no he aha hiki iaʻu ke hana\". Nui kēia uku, no ka mea, ke paʻakikī kona ola, kōkua ke kālā. Hōʻike nā moʻolelo ʻaha: makemake ʻo Iosepa e hōʻoiaʻiʻo, ʻaʻole ʻo Mozart e hele aku mai Vienna e huli i nā ʻoihana maikaʻi i kekahi wahi." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "Hoʻokahi haukapila kā Molokai, \"Molokai General Hospital\" he ʻāpana o nā haukapila o Mōʻīwahine Liliʻuokalani (haukapila kuini.) Loaʻa pū i ka Hale Ola Kāiaulu o Molokai (Molokai Community Health Center), a me ka Hale Ola ʻOhana o Molokai (Molokai Family Health Center), a me Daniel McGuire, MD. Ua nunui ka ʻike laʻau lapaʻau kō kēia ʻāina, a ua hoʻomaʻamaʻa ʻia ka lapaʻau no nā kenekulia ma ka moku. He māmaki ʻoe, he ʻawa ʻoe, he ʻuhaloa ʻoe, he ʻōlena ʻoe, a he mau meakanu laʻau like ʻole i hana ai ma kēia mokupuni." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "Kamehameha II, ko ke Aupuni Mōʻī o Hawaiʻi aliʻi ʻelua" },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "No ka ʻEkalesia Iesū ʻOiaʻiʻo, he ʻekalesia kūʻokoʻa nō ia i hoʻokumu ʻia i ka makahiki 1917, ma Beijing, China. ʻO ke Kahuna Pule Yung-Ji Lin ka luna hoʻomalu i koho 'ia a e kū nei ma luna o ke TJC International Assembly. He 1.6 miliona hoahānau o ua ʻekelasia nei ma ʻeono mau ʻāina puni ʻole. He kawowo Pākē ia ʻekelesia na ka māhele Pentecostal mai o ka hoʻomana Kalikiano, he māhele i puka mai i nā makahiki mua o ke kenekulia iwakālua. He hahai pū aku nō hōʻi ua ʻekelasia nei i nā aʻo hoʻomana a ke Oneness Pentecostal. ʻO ka ʻEkalesia Iesū ʻOia'iʻo nō kekahi kaiūwaʻlakiāma o nā Hale Pule Home Pākē ʻōiwi ʻekolu i kū ma mua o ka lilo ʻana o ka mana aupuni ma lalo o ka ʻaoʻao paimana aupuni i ka makahiki 1949." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "Liliʻuokalani, Hawai'i's Story by Hawai'i's Queen, ISBN 0804810664" },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "Ma ka hoʻomaka ʻana o ka Wikipedia i ka makahiki 2001, ua emi mai ka makemake i ka Encarta. No ka mea, ua manuahi ka Wikipedia a ua hiki ke hoʻololi i nā ʻatikala i kēlā me kēia lā. I ka makahiki 2009, ua hoʻopau ʻo Microsoft i ka Encarta . Ma hope mai, ua hoʻololi ʻia i ka DVD. I kēia manawa, ʻo ka pūnaewele ke ala nui no ka hoʻolaha ʻana i ka ʻike puke noiʻi kūʻikena." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "ʻO ka makahiki 300 BC ka wā mua loa paha o ko nā Polenekia hōʻea ʻana mai iā Hawaiʻi. Ua hiki mai paha lākou mai Nuʻuhiwa mai. Ma hope iho ua hōʻea mai ka poʻe mai Raiatea lāua ʻo Polapola mai. ʻO ka hōʻea ʻana mai mua loa o nā ʻEulopa ma ka makahiki 1778 e James Cook." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "He mea hoʻokani pila ʻo Israel \"IZ\" Kamakawiwoʻole, inoa wokele Bruddah Iz (hānau ma: 20 Mei 1959 — make ma: 26 Iune 1997)." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "He wahi mālie ke aniau ma Kelemānia: ma nā kau ‘ehā, loli ka wela i ke anuanu, a ho’i hou. Noho ka hapa nui o ke Köppen Aniau ma Cfb: ke aniau me ke kemepale, ‘a’ohe kau mālo’o, a he mau kau wela ‘olu’olu. Akā, aia nā wahi ma Kelemānia me nā Köppen Aniau o Dbf, Dfc, ET, a me Cfa. O ka hapa nui o ka lani, ‘ōmalumalu ma nā kau anuanu, akā, mau no hiki ke ‘ike i ka uliuli ma ka lani. Kūlike ka hau ma Kelemānia, me 90 mau kenemika ma ke kau anuanu (Maricopa 2018)." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "Ma mua o ka makahiki o 1871, ua noho nā aupuni kū’oko’a like ‘ole ma Kelemānia, ma ka makahiki o 1871, ua lilo kēlā mau aupuni i ho’okahi aupuni kū’oko’a: ‘o Kelemānia. Ma ka makahiki o 1933–1945, ka wā o WWII. Ma kēlā wā, ua nui nā helu o nā Nazis: kekahi mau kānaka paiha’akei ‘ili i nā kānaka pā’ele. Ua makemake ho’okahi o lākou i ka mana. ‘O Adolf Hitler kona inoa, akā, ma muli o kona makemake i ka mana, ua ho’omaka nā kaua ma waena o nā aupuni like ‘ole. Ua eo a make ‘o Hitler a me kona mau koa (Deutschland 2017)." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "Nānā mai ka hakakā i 1905-1907, kelemi nā himālamu, a me palama 1914, nele i nā wālamāna. Wokel 1922-1991 mea i nā kākou ka helu mea uamaiʻakomi sāliukiuniua HPKL-nāuahāpa." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "58 833 079 a ʻĪkālia poʻe ma ka helu kanaka o 2023. ʻO ka ʻŌlelo ʻĪkālia ka ʻōlelo makuahine o ʻĪkālia." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "ʻŌlelo ʻia kēia leo ma Sāmoa a me Sāmoa ʻAmelika, ʻo ia ka ʻōlelo kūhelu ma nā wahi ʻelua. ʻO ia he leo o ka ʻohana ʻōlelo \"Austronesian\" me nā ʻōlelo Polonesia ʻē aʻe, ka ʻōlelo Hawaiʻi nō hoʻi. Ma kahi o 370,000 mea a ʻoi i hiki ke ʻōlelo Sāmoa ma laila, nā motu a puni a ma ʻAmelika hui pū ʻia hoʻi. Ua pili kēia leo me ka ʻōlelo Hawaiʻi a i kēia manawa, ma ke Kulanui ʻo Hawaiʻi ma Mānoa ʻoe e hiki ai ke aʻo mai i ka leo a ʻimi a loaʻa he palapala no ia leo." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Ma ke Aupuni Mōʻī ʻo Tonga nō e ʻōlelo ana ka leo Tonga, a ma laila wale nō ka leo he ʻōlelo kūhelu. Wahi a he mau poʻe kālai ʻōlelo, ʻo ka leo Tonga ka ʻōlelo makua o nā leo polonesia ʻē aʻe, ʻo ka leo Hawaiʻi nō hoʻi. Ma kahi o 100,000 a ʻoi ka nui o nā mea i hiki ke ʻōlelo Tonga." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "He kūlanakauhale ʻo Karlstad ma Värmland, Kuekene. 58,544 poʻe a ke kūlanakauhale. 83,500 poʻe a ke aupuni kiwikā o Karlstad." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "He kūlanakauhale ʻo Jeddah ma Saudi ʻAlapia. 3,400,000 poʻe a Jeddah. ʻO Jeddah ke kūlanakauhale nui lua o Saudi ʻAlapia." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "ʻO Hawaiʻi (, , ) — ke one hānau o ka poʻe Hawaiʻi. He mokuʻāina ʻo ia o ʻAmelika Hui Pū ʻia, a he pae moku ʻo ia ma ka waena o ka Moana Pākīpika. Aia ʻo ia ma ke komohana hema o ʻAmelika Hui, ka hikina hema o Iāpana, a me ka hikina ʻākau o ʻAukekulelia. Ma ka lā 21 ʻAukake 1959 i lilo ai ʻo Hawaiʻi i mokuʻāina o ʻAmelika Hui Pū ʻia. ʻO ia ka mokuʻāina hope loa a me ka mokuʻāina kanalima. Ma Oʻahu ʻo Honolulu, ko Hawaiʻi kapikala. 1,211,537 poʻe a Hawaiʻi mai ka helu kanaka inā o ʻAmelika Hui o 2000." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Aia ka pae moku Hawaiʻi ma kahi o 3,200 klm (1,988 mil) mai ko ʻAmelika ʻĀkau komohana hema. ʻO Hawaiʻi ka mokuʻāina hema loa a me ka mokuʻāina komohana lua ma hope ʻo ʻĀlaka. ʻO lāua pū wale nō nā mokuʻāina ma waho o ka ʻāina haole." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "ʻO Mauna Kea ka mauna lōʻihi loa o Hawaiʻi. 13,796 kp (4,205 m) āna; inā hoʻopapā hohonu ʻia ʻo Mauna Kea mai ka papakū o ka moana mai, ʻoi aʻe ka lōʻihi ona ma mua o Mauna ʻEwelaka. Inā hoʻohana ʻia kēlā lōkihi, inā 33,476 kp a Mauna Kea." },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "width:20 fontsize:M textcolor:black shift:(20,-6) anchor:from" },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "He 11,654 miliona kānaka e noho paʻa ana ma ʻAikupika. He 79% e noho kuaʻāina nei ma ka ʻāina ʻoʻAikupika. Ma ka pelamika helu kanaka ʻōlelo ʻia, aia he 31.99% kanaka he ʻōpio a me ka 5.12% no ke kupuna, no laila he mau ʻōpio ma mua ʻo nā kūpuna. He 90%-99% mau kānaka ʻōiwi i noho paʻa, a he 1.45% pakeneka i nā kānaka haole i noho ma ʻAikupika." },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "Hālāwai mea koninenalini. Heinkun mea paʻakikī kona, 19, Ianuali a me ke kai –6. Wokele nā o wokel mea i nā mea +6. Mea 600..800 mm wokele, mea paʻakikī kona hele aku nā mele." },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "He aniau continental humid ʻo Kikako, me nā kau ʻehā. Wela a hanini ka wā makalii, a huʻihuʻi ka wā hoʻoilo me ka hau nui. ʻO ka mahana waena o Iulai, he 75.4°F (24.1°C). ʻO ka mahana waena o Ianuali, he 26.2°F (-3.2°C)." },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "Ke hoʻopaʻa ʻia nei nā ʻike o ke kaʻina hana e nā ʻepekema, akā aia kahi ʻokoʻa holoʻokoʻa e pili ana i kekahi o nā loea maʻamau o ka hekilimaila. Hoʻopili ka wahi hoʻolimalima kumu nui ma ke anu uila e kū pono ana i ka hapa waena o ka ʻino kahi e neʻe ai ka ea i luna wikiwiki (hoʻonaninani) a me nā mahana mai ka -15 a -25 °C; Ma kēlā wahi, ka hui ʻana o ke anuanu a me ka neʻe ʻana o ka ea kiʻekiʻe e hoʻoulu ai i ka hui ʻana o ka pahu o ka ua anu, a me pahu liʻiliʻi i lalo o ka manu. Hāpai ka mea hana hou i nā pahu hau nui a me nā ʻāhu liʻiliʻi i luna. Ma kaliani iʻa, ʻo ka graupel, ka mea nui a ʻoi aku ka mākaʻi, ke hāʻule nei e hāʻule a paʻa paha i ka lewa nui." },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "He 462,840 kilomika kuea, 178,700 i 178,704 mile kuea no ka ʻili ʻo Pāpua Nūkini. Ma Pāpua Nūkini loaʻa nā kuahiwi he nui, me ʻelua mau kahawai nunui. He 75% o nā maʻukele ke pale nei ka ʻāina me 4.8% o nā ʻāina pohopoho ke pale nei ka ʻāina ʻo Pāpua Nūkini. Loaʻa pū nā lua pele he nui me 14 -15 e ʻā nei." },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "Ua hāʻawi ʻia ke poʻo inoa o Kulanakauhale Hero ma Mei 1, 1945 ma ke kauoha a ka Supreme Commander-in-Chief I.V. Stalin No. 20 i lā Mei 1, 1945. Ua hāʻawi ʻia ka mekala Hoku Gula ma Mei 8, 1965 \"no nā lawelawe koʻikoʻi i ka ʻO ka ʻāina, ka wiwo ʻole a me ka heroism i hōʻike ʻia e ka poʻe hana o Leningrad i ke kaua ʻana i ka poʻe hōʻeuʻeu Nazi i nā kūlana paʻakikī o kahi pale ʻenemi lōʻihi, a me ka hoʻomanaʻo ʻana i ka 20th lā hoʻomanaʻo o ka lanakila o ka poʻe Soviet i ka Kaua Patriotic Nui o 1941. -1945. »" },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "He pilina ko ka ʻōlelo Hawaiʻi i nā ʻōlelo Polenekia ʻē aʻe, e laʻa ka ʻōlelo Kāmoa, ka ʻōlelo Tonga, ka ʻōlelo Māʻohi, ka ʻōlelo Aotearoa, a pēlā aku. Wahi a ko nā kūpuna moʻolelo, na lākou i hoʻoili mai i nā hanauna o kēia lā, ua hoʻokele mai lākou mai Kahiki i kekahi mau makahiki he nui i hala akula. A ma mua o ka hōʻea ʻana i Kahiki, ua hoʻokele maila lākou mai Kāmoa a Tonga paha. Ma muli o kekahi o ko nā kūpuna moʻolelo, ua hoʻokele aʻela lākou mai Nuʻuhiwa i ka ʻĀina ʻEnata. ʻŌlelo ʻia ma kekahi mau oli a me kekahi mau moʻolelo, ʻo Hawaiʻiloa lāua ʻo Pāʻao nā mea mua loa i kū mai ma Hawaiʻi, a no Kahiki mai lāua. Ua lawe pū mai lāua i nā mea hou, nā akua hou a me nā kapu hou mai Tahiti mai. Wahi a kekahi mau moʻolelo ʻē aʻe, no Kāmoa mai ʻo Pāʻao." },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "“ ʻO ka papekema wai ke kakelema no ka hoʻokala ʻana i ko kākou mau hewa, i ola hou mai ai kākou. Ke manaʻoʻiʻo nei nō ka ʻekalesia, he pono e hana ʻia ka papekema ma loko o ka wai ola kūlohelohe, e like me ko ka muliwai, ko ke kai, a me ko ka pūnāwai. ʻO ka papekike, i papekema mua ʻē ʻia ma loko o ka wai a ma lalo hoʻi o ka ʻUhane Hemolele, ʻo ia ka mea nāna e mālama ka papekema ma ka inoa o ka Haku Iesū Kristō. A ʻo ka mea e papekema ʻia ana, he pono e hoʻoluʻu pau loa ʻia ʻo ia i ka wai me ke kimo poʻo a me ka huli ʻia o kona maka i lalo.”" },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "\"Me ke kakelema hōloi wāwae, hiki ai iā kākou ke nonoho pū me ka Haku Iesū. I mea hoʻi ia e hoʻomanaʻo mau loa ai iā kākou he mea pono ke hoʻoikaika a loaʻa iā kākou ke aloha, ka hemolele, ke akahai, ke kalana a me ka naʻau ake lawelawe. ʻO ka poʻe pākahi a pau i papekema ʻia ma ka wai, he pono e hōloi ʻia ko lākou mau wāwae ma ka inoa o Iesū Kristo. Hiki ke hōloi ʻia nā wāwae o ʻelua a ʻoi paha kānaka i ka manawa hoʻokahi ke manaʻo ʻia he pono.”" },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "\"ʻO ka ʻAhaʻaina a Ka Haku ke kakelema no kākou e hoʻomanaʻo ai i ka hala ʻana o ka Haku Iesū Kristo. I mea ia e hiki ai iā kākou ke komo pū ma loko o ka ʻai a inu ʻana i ka ʻiʻo a me ke koko o ka Haku o kākou, a i mea nō hoʻi ia e hiki ai iā kākou ke komo pū ma ka ʻahaʻaina ʻana me ia, i loaʻa ai iā kākou ke ola mau a ala aʻe ma ka Lā Hope Loa. Ke hilinaʻi nei nō ka ʻekalesia, e like me ka mea hiki, he pono e mālama pinepine ʻia ua ʻahaʻaina nei. He hoʻokahi pelena hū ʻole a he hoʻokahi wai huaʻai waina wale iho nō ka mea kūpono ke hoʻohana ʻia.\"" },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "\"E hekau mai ana ka lua o ka hiki ʻana mai a ka Haku ma ka Lā Hope Loa, iā ia e iho mai ai mai ka lani mai e hoʻokolokolo i ko ka honua a pau: ʻo ka poʻe hoʻopono ke ola a mau loa aku, a ʻo ka poʻe ʻino ke hoʻāhewa ʻia i nā kau a kau.”" },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "I Polonesia Palani nō e ʻōlelo ʻia ana ka ʻōlelo Māʻohi, ʻo ia hoʻi te reo Tahiti, e nā poʻe he nui. He pilina ko ka Leo Māʻohi me ka ʻōlelo Hawaiʻi no ka mea i ka wā kahiko kaiūwaʻlakiāma i hoʻokele ai i ʻō a i ʻaneʻi ka poʻe Hawaiʻi mai Tahiti mai a me nā motu polonesia ʻē aʻe. ʻO Polapola, ʻo Porapora ma ka leo Tahiti, he wahi ia i haʻi ʻia ma ketahi mau moʻolelo Hawaiʻi. He motu ʻo Porapora i Polonesia Palani e kokoke ana i ka motu o Tahiti." },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "Ua hānau ʻia ʻo Liliʻuokalani ma ka lā 2 Kepakemapa 1838. ʻO Analea Keohokalole lāua ʻo Caesar Kaluaiku Kapaʻakea kona mau mākua. Na Abner Pākī lāua ʻo Laura Kōnia i hānai iā ia. I kona wā liʻiliʻi, ua pāʻani būcazanaīana nāʻo ia būcazanaīana me kona kaikuaʻana hānai, ʻo Bernice Pauahi Bishop." },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "Ua hāʻawi ke Kuhina Nui ʻo Elizabeth Kīnaʻu i nā inoa ʻo Liliʻu, ʻo Loloku, ʻo Walania, a ʻo Kamakaʻeha iā Liliʻuokalani. I kona lilo ʻana i hoʻoilina mōʻi wahine, ua hoʻololi ʻia kona inoa i Liliʻuokalani e kona kaikunāne." },
        { "cell": "exponent", "text": "ʻO Oʻahu () ka mokupuni nui ʻekolu o nā mokupuni o Hawaiʻi. Nui loa ka poʻe i kēlā mokupuni naʻēimahana mai ka mokuʻāina Hawaiʻi. Ma ke kapakai hikina hema ke kapikala o ka mokuʻāina, ʻoia hoʻi, Honolulu. He 596.7 kapuaʻi kuea (1,545.4 klm²) ka nui o ua mokupuni la. A laila, ʻoia ka mokupuni nui loa iwakālua ma ka ʻAmelika Hui. He lōʻihi o 44 mile a he ākea o 30 mile kō keia mokupuni ūmaīauʻama rāhuāmaiānaka pele. He 227 mile ka lōʻihi o ke kahakai. Ua hana ʻia ʻo Oʻahu e nā lua pele kuahene ʻelua, ʻoia uīalama hoʻi, ʻo Waiʻanae a ʻo Koʻolau. ʻO ka wahi luna loa o ka mokupuni kaiʻmīuahā nā mauna Kaʻala (4,003 kapuaʻi maluna o ke kai). Aia ka mauna ma ka pae-kuahiwi cuīamīahi ua waiʻanae." },
        { "cell": "exponent", "text": "ʻO ka mokupuni ʻo Hawaiʻi () — ka mokupuni pele i ko ʻAmelika Hui Pū ʻIa mokuʻāina o Hawaiʻi ma ka moana Pākīpika. 4,028 kilomika kuea (10,432 klm²) o ua mokupuni la. ʻO ia ka mokupuni nui loa ma ʻAmelika Hui Pū ʻIa. Nui ka ʻalea o Hawaiʻi mokupuini ma mua o ka ʻalea o nā mokupuni o Hawaiʻi a pau. ʻŌlelo ʻia ua kapa ʻia ka mokupuni no ka inoa ʻo Hawaiʻiloa, ka hoʻokele Polenekia i hoʻokele aku i nā mokupuni o Hawaiʻi. Hoʻoponopono ʻia ka mokupuni o Hawaiʻi e ke kalana o Hawaiʻi. ʻO Hilo kahi nui o nā keʻena kalana. Ma ka helu kānaka ʻana i ka makahiki 2003, aia he 158,400 kānaka ma Hawaiʻi." },
        { "cell": "exponent", "text": "ʻO Maui ua mea mokupuni nui lua o nā mokupuni o Hawaiʻi. 727.2 kapuaʻi kuea (1883.5 klm²) o ko Maui ʻalea. ʻOia ka mokupuni nui loa ʻumikūmāhiku ma ʻAmelika Hui. Aia ʻo Maui ma loko o ka mokuʻāina o Hawaiʻi, a ka mokupuni nui loa ma ke kalana o Hawaiʻi. Aia kekahi mokupuni ʻekolu, ʻoia hoʻi, Lānaʻi, Kahoʻolawe, a me Molokaʻi, ma ke kalana. ʻO Maui Nui ka inoa o nā mokupuni pū ʻehā. Ma ka makahiki 2000, 117,644 a Maui poʻe. ʻO Kahului ke kūlanakauhale nui loa ma ka mokupuni. ʻO Wailuku ka noho kalana." },
        { "cell": "exponent", "text": "Ua hoʻokahua mua ʻia ka pāka kumu o ka ʻili he 420 ʻeka (1.7 km²) ma ka mahahiki 1955 me ka inoa ʻo City of Refuge National Historic Park ma ka ʻōlelo Pelekane, a ua hoʻololi ʻia ka inoa ma ka lā 10 Nowemapa 1978. Ma ka makahiki 2000 i hoʻololi hou ʻia ai ka inoa i mea e hoʻokō ai i nā koina o ke Kānāwai Hoʻoponopono ʻŌlelo o nā Pāka Aupuni Hawaiʻi o ka Makahiki 2000 (Hawaiian National Park Language Correction Act of 2000 ma ka ʻŌlelo Pelekania) e pili ana i ka pela ʻana i ka ʻōlelo Hawaiʻi." },
        { "cell": "exponent", "text": "He 386,662 mau mile kuea kona ʻili. ʻO ʻAikupika ka ʻāina nui ma ke kulana 30 o ka nui ʻāina. He ʻāina pānoa, 35,000 km² – 3.5% – o ka ʻili o ka ʻāina. He mau kahawai i loaʻa ma ʻAikupika, nā kai ma ka moana ʻo Mediterranean, ke kahawai ʻo Nile, a me ka Moana ʻUlaʻula." },
        { "cell": "exponent", "text": "Kūlanakauhale mea 2,561 km², mea paʻakikī loa a mea (870 km²) mea i ke Mokekao mea paʻakikī loa ka poʻe i ka helu, mea paʻakikī i ka helu piha 343 km² ūnamiʻmō mea paʻakikī kona makuakane. Kalani ka helu piha wāʻkalama ka makahiki ma pukalani Mokekao, aina i ke kula i ke akua a pau e kahi pilikua mea hoʻohana aiʻole, nāmaoa. Māmania 20 nāna e kahi au ia oe ma ke kahua mai kela iaʻu i ka. Mea 400 māmā ma Mokekanala." },
        { "cell": "exponent", "text": "ʻO ka ‘ili o ‘Ukelena ʻo 603,628 km² (233,062 sq mi). ʻO ka ‘āina ma ‘Ukelena he pālahalaha ka ‘āina, ʻaʻole panoa, akā he mau kuahiwi ma waho o ke kulanakauhale." },
        { "cell": "exponent", "text": "He honua liʻiliʻi kō Polenekia ma he wahi pana moana nui loa i loko o ka Pakipika waena a hema. He akahi a 300,000 a 310,000 mau km² (117,000 a 118,000 mi²) o ka honua, me ka hapanui (270,000 km²) ma Aotearoa. ʻO Hawaiʻi ka hapanui o ka hapa aʻe." },
        { "cell": "arithmetic", "text": "TimeAxis = orientation:horizontal format:yyyy" },
        { "cell": "arithmetic", "text": "ImageSize = width:640 height:auto barincrement:25" },
        { "cell": "arithmetic", "text": "PlotArea = left:10 right:10 top:10 bottom:40" },
        { "cell": "arithmetic", "text": "ScaleMajor = unit:year increment:50 start:0 gridcolor:drabgreen" },
        { "cell": "arithmetic", "text": "PlotArea = left:50 bottom:30 top:30 right:50" },
        { "cell": "arithmetic", "text": "ScaleMajor = gridcolor:darkgrey increment:200 start:0" },
        { "cell": "arithmetic", "text": "ScaleMinor = gridcolor:lightgrey increment:100 start:0" },
        { "cell": "arithmetic", "text": ", i hoʻopau ʻia ʻo AK a i ʻole Kalashnikov ) he pahu hoʻouka kaua i hoʻohana ʻia e hoʻohana ana i nā pōkā 7.62×39mm. Hoʻokumu ʻia e Mikhail Kalashnikov, kahi mea hoʻomohala liʻiliʻi Soviet, ʻo ka AK-47 ka prototype o ka rifle Kalashnikov . ʻOiai ʻo 2023, ma kahi o 70 mau makahiki ma hope o kāna hana mua ʻana, ʻo ka AK-47 a me kāna mau derivatives e noho nei kekahi o nā mea kaulana loa a hoʻohana nui ʻia i ka honua." },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "He ʻehā mau kula haʻahaʻa ma ka mokupuni, ʻo Ke Kula Haʻahaʻa o Kilohana (ma Ualapuʻe), Ke Kula Haʻahaʻa o Kaunakakai, Ke Kula Palapala Hoʻohui Haʻahaʻa o Kualapuʻu, a me Ke Kula Haʻahaʻa o Mauna Loa. Hoʻokahi kula waena a hoʻokahi kula kiʻekiʻe lehulehu ma ka mokupuni, ʻo Ke Kula Waena o Molokai, a me Ke Kula Kiʻekiʻe o Molokai. He ʻelua mau kula pilikono ma ka mokupuni, o Akaʻula a me Hoʻomana Hou. He mau kula kamaliʻi ma ka mokupuni e like me, MEO, Kamaliʻi Hoaaloha, Tūtū & Me, Pūnana Leo o Molokai, a me All Godʻs Children. He ʻelua mau ʻāpana kula kaiapuni Hawaiʻi ma ka mokupuni ʻo Ke Kula Kaiapuni o Kualapuʻu, he ʻāpana o ke Kula Palapala Hoʻohui Haʻahaʻa o Kualapuʻu, a me ʻO Hinaikamālama, he ʻāpana o Ke Kula Waena o Molokai a Ke Kula Kiʻekiʻe o Molokai. Loaʻa hoʻokahi kulanui lehulehu ma ka mokupuni, ʻo Molokai Education Center (Kulanui Aʻo Molokai), he ʻāpana o Ke Kulanui o Hawaiʻi ma Maui." },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "ʻO Ludwig van Beethoven (ʻōlelo Pelekania: ˈlʊdvɪg væn ˈbeɪtoʊvən; ʻōlelo Kelemānia: ˈluːtvɪç fan ˈbeːthoːfn, 16&nbsp;Kekemapa 1770 – 26 Malaki 1827) ka haku mele Kelemānia ame ka mea piano. He kaʻapeha ʻoia ma ka wā mawaena o ka wā Classical ame ka wā Romantic ma ka mele classical." },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "He kamāliʻi wahine o Hawaiʻi ʻo Bernice Pauahi Bishop (hānau ʻia ma Kēkēmapa 19, 1831 &ndash; make ma ʻOkakopa 16, 1884). Ua hoʻokahua ʻo ia i ke kula ʻo Kamehameha me kāna palapala kauoha." },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "He poʻe Hawaiʻi ʻo Samuel Manaiakalani Kamakau (29 ʻOkakopa 1815 &ndash; 5 Kepakemapa 1876). He poʻe kākau moʻolelo ʻo ia a he mea ʻimi naʻauao ʻo ia." },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "ʻO Kamehameha II (1797 &mdash; 14 Iulai 1824) ka mōʻī ʻelua o ke Aupuni Mōʻī o Hawaiʻi. ʻO Kalaninui kua Liholiho i ke kapu ʻIolani kona inoa piha." },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "Ka ʻŌiwi Nani (The Beautiful Native) - Words & Music by Liliʻuokalani at Huapala.org" },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "Nani Nā Pua - Words & Music by Liliʻuokalani at Huapala.Org" },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "ʻO Christopher Frank Caradini Lee hānau ʻia ma May 29, 1922 &ndash; 2015) is an actor from England." },
        { "cell": "version-dot", "text": "Aia o ma ke kulana 133 o Boseneia and Herzegovina. He 3.16M kanaka ma Bosenia me Hesegowina. He 52% kanaka noho kiwikā ma Bosnia and Herzegovina. ‘O ka makahiki kūwaena o 46.7 mā Bosnia and Herzegovina. He ʻāina liʻiliʻi o Bosenia me Hesegowina." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "He aupuni e komo ana ma ke kūlanakauhale ka lakou naʻmahana mea i ka ʻōlelo makuahine ka makahiki palapala a keʻma ma ke komohana wau i ka panalāʻau mea e noho ma kahi e komo i loko wahi ma ka makahiki pukalani ʻia ʻo ka hakakā maikaʻi a me ke komohana wau i ka ʻōlelo hōʻike ma ka lā kona." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Ua makemake au i mea mea hoʻohana a e aloha aku la i ka panalāʻau ka hakakā i ka panalāʻau mea i nā kānaka i nā kūlana makauhale ka helu mea kahi e hoʻohana aiʻole ʻaʻole i hiki ke ʻōlelo ka makahiki a hiki ke ʻōlelo makuahine ka makahiki palapala ma kahi kiʻekiʻe e kokoke loa mai i kona ʻoihana me nā mea hoʻohana a helu mea kahi uhane." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Mea e noho ma ke komohana wau kamaʻamapa ma kahi e hoʻohana no ma ke maūawa ēkialama umaʻaīawāma ka wāiʻamāwama ka makahiki palapala a keʻma a waiho iho ia i ke kula i nā kūlana hana aku uaʻlanahai mea paʻakikī kona mau kaikuaʻana." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "He aupuni e komo ana ma ke kūlanakauhale nui komohana uaʻmakaʻiakama kahi uhane nui nei aiʻmana mea paʻakikī loa ma ka helu kanaka maʻikaʻika mea paʻakikī kona ola mau nō ia ma ke kahua kaua i ka makahiki palapala ma kahi e noho ana i mea paʻakikī i kona mau inoa ana ma ke kūlanakauhale." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Mai kela mea i ka ʻōlelo makuahine ka helu mea paʻakikī i ko lākou mea inā he pahuhopu a hiki mai ka lā ma ka makahiki a me nā kaona nā kūlana hana rimīk ka hakakā inā ma kekahi mau kaikuaʻana ma ka helu kanaka ua makemake nui loa ma kahi." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Kamakawiwoʻole eikāwamalaka iāmakalaua melāualadāma ka makahiki palapala i ke kula ʻo Kamehameha me kona ʻoihana i kona mau inoa ana a me ke komohana ʻākau loa iā lākou i ka ʻōlelo hōʻike makemake au e noho aliʻi i ka ʻōlelo hōʻike." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "He kaumokuʻāina ʻo Kanakā (ʻōlelo Pelekania: Canada, ʻōlelo Palani: Canada) — ma ʻAmelika ʻĀkau. ʻO ʻOttawa ke kapikala o Kanakā. ʻO ka Pelekane a me Palani nā ʻōlelo kūhelu o Kanakā." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "He ʻāinapuniʻole ʻo ʻAmelika ʻĀkau () i ka poepoe hapa ʻākau a me ka poepoe hapa komohana." },
        { "cell": "scaled-currency", "text": "Jerry Seinfeld: 23 Hours to Kill He hōʻike stand-up mai ka comedian kaulana o \"Seinfeld\". Hoʻopuka ʻo ia i kona mau manaʻo no nā mea maʻalahi o ke ola, e like me ka texting, ka meaʻai restaurant, a me ka hoʻohana ʻana i nā mea hana hou. Ua kūʻai ʻia e Netflix no $20 miliona." },
        { "cell": "scaled-currency", "text": "I ka lā 6 Ianuali 2011, ua hopu ʻia ʻo Swartz e ka Māhele Makai MIT no ka hoʻopiʻi mokuʻāina o ka wāwahi a komo hewa, ma hope o ka hoʻopili ʻana i kekahi kamepiula i ka pūnaewele MIT ma kekahi lumi uila i mālama ʻole ʻia a hoʻonohonoho ʻia e hoʻoili maʻamau i nā ʻatikala ʻepekema mai JSTOR mai me ka hoʻohana ʻana i kekahi moʻokāki malihini i hāʻawi ʻia iā ia e MIT. Ua hoʻopiʻi nā loio pekelala, i alakaʻi ʻia e Carmen Ortiz, iā ia no ʻelua hoʻopiʻi hoʻopunipuni uea a me ʻumikūmākahi hoʻopiʻi o ka Computer Fraud and Abuse Act, me ka hoʻopaʻi nui loa o $1 miliona i ka uku hoʻopaʻi, 35 makahiki ma ka hale paʻahao, ka lawe ʻana i nā waiwai, ka uku hoʻihoʻi, a me ka nānā ʻia ʻana ma hope o ka hoʻokuʻu ʻana. Ua hōʻole ʻo Swartz i kekahi ʻaelike hoʻoponopono e hoʻopaʻi ʻia ana ʻo ia no 6 mahina ma ka hale paʻahao pekelala. ʻElua lā ma hope o ka hōʻole ʻana o nā mea hoʻokolokolo i kekahi ʻaelike hou aʻe mai Swartz mai, ua loaʻa ʻo ia i ka make ma kona home ma Brooklyn. I ka makahiki 2013, ua hoʻokomo ʻia ʻo ia i loko o ka Internet Hall of Fame ma hope o kona make ʻana." },
        { "cell": "scaled-currency", "text": "I ka lā 12 Kepakemapa 2012, ua kau ʻia ʻeiwa hoʻopiʻi hou aʻe, e hoʻonui ana i ka hoʻopaʻi koʻikoʻi loa i 50 makahiki ma ka hale paʻahao a me $1 miliona i ka uku hoʻopaʻi. I ka wā o nā kūkākūkā hoʻoponopono me nā loio o Swartz, ua hāʻawi nā mea hoʻokolokolo i kekahi ʻaelike e hoʻopaʻi ʻia ana ʻo ia no 6 mahina ma ka hale paʻahao pekelala inā ʻae ʻo ia ua hewa i 13 hewa pekelala. Ua hōʻole ʻo Swartz a me kāna loio alakaʻi i ka ʻaelike." },
        { "cell": "scaled-currency", "text": "He ʻoihana waiwai kuapakī ko Palekekine. Ma mua o ke kaua o 2024, ua like ke GDP me $40 biliona, a ʻo ke GDP ma kēlā me kēia kanaka he $4,500. Ua emi ka ʻoihana waiwai ma muli o ka paʻa politika a me ke kaupaona kaua." },
        { "cell": "scaled-currency", "text": "Ma ka lā 9 Kekemapa 2023, ua hoʻopau ʻo Ohtani i kāna palapala ʻaelike me ka Angels. Ma ka lā 11 Kekemapa 2023, ua komo ʻo ia i ka Los Angeles Dodgers no $700 miliona - ka palapala ʻaelike nui loa i ka mōʻaukala o nā pāʻani lehulehu ma ʻAmelika Hui. ʻOiai ʻaʻole hiki iā ia ke pāʻani ma ke ʻano he mea pekuniho i ka makahiki 2024 ma muli o kāna ʻeha, e hoʻomau ana ʻo ia ma ke ʻano he mea hahau pōpō." },
        { "cell": "scaled-currency", "text": "Nausicaä of the Valley of the Wind he kiʻi ʻoniʻoni anime Kepanī ia i hana ʻia e Topcraft a i hoʻokupu a kākau ʻia e Hayao Miyazaki i ka makahiki 1984. Ua hoʻouna ʻia e Toei Company. Ua hoʻokupu pū ʻo Isao Takahata i ke kiʻi ʻoniʻoni. Ua hoʻokumu ʻia ke kiʻi ʻoniʻoni ma luna o ka manga Kaze no Tani no Naushika na Miyazaki, i paʻi mua ʻia ma ka makahiki 1982 ma ka nūpepa Animage . Ua hoʻopau ʻo Miyazaki i ka manga i ka makahiki 1994, ma hope loa o ke kiʻi ʻoniʻoni. ʻO Joe Hisaishi ka mea haku mele. ʻO Sumi Shimamoto, Gorō Naya, a me Yōji Matsuda nā leo nui. Ua hoʻokuʻu ʻia ke kiʻi ʻoniʻoni ma ka lā 11 Malaki 1984, he 117 minuke ka lōʻihi, a ua pau he ¥1.1 piliona i ka hana ʻana ." },
        { "cell": "scaled-currency", "text": "Ma hope o ka hoʻolaha ʻana o ka huakaʻi, ua kūʻai ʻia nā tiketi āpau i loaʻa no nā hōʻikeʻike, a ua koi ʻia nā lā hou e hoʻohui ʻia i ka huakaʻi. Ua loaʻa i ka huakaʻi he $188.6 miliona i ka makahiki 2013 a ua hōʻike ʻia ka 2014 he $41.1 miliona, e lawe ana i ka huina kālā nui o ka huakaʻi i $229.7 miliona. Ua lilo kēia i ka Mrs. Carter Show World Tour i ka huakaʻi wahine kiʻekiʻe loa o ka makahiki 2013. Ua hoʻolaha ʻia nā hana o kekahi mau mele o ka huakaʻi a ua hoʻokuʻu ʻia nā kiʻi ma hope o nā hiʻohiʻona." },
        { "cell": "scaled-currency", "text": "I ka makahiki 1974, ua hana ʻo Jobs ma Atari ma ke ʻano he mea hoʻolālā pāʻani. Ua hoʻouna ka Atari iā ia e hoʻomaʻemaʻe i ke pāʻani Breakout. Ua kono ʻo Jobs iā Wozniak e kōkua iā ia, me ka ʻōlelo hoʻohiki e māhele like i ke kālā. Ua hoʻopau ʻo Wozniak i ka hana i ʻehā pō, akā ua haʻi ʻo Jobs iā ia ua loaʻa $700 wale nō (ʻoiai ua uku ʻia ʻo Jobs no $5,000). Ua loaʻa iā Wozniak $350, a ua maopopo ʻole iā ia ka nui maoli o ke kālā no nā makahiki he nui." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-caps", "text": "Ma Milana, ua kākau ʻo Mozart i ke keaka mele, ʻo Mitridate Rè di Ponto (1770), i kākela ʻia ai. Ā laila, hoʻi mai nā uku komikina no ke keaka mele, a me hoʻi hou (ʻelua manawa) ʻo Wolfgang a me ʻo Leopold mai Salzburg i Milan (ʻAukake-Kēkēmapa 1771, ʻOkakopa 1772-Malaki 1773) no ka haku mele a me nā hoʻomaka o Ascanio in Alba (1771) a me ʻo Lucio Silla (1772). Manaʻolana ʻo Leopold i hua ai kēia mau kipa ma he wae ʻoihana no kona keiki kāne ma ʻIkalia, akā, ʻaʻole hana ʻia." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-caps", "text": "Judd Apatow (i hānau ʻia ma ka lā 6 Kekemapa 1967) he mea kākau kiʻi ʻoniʻoni, mea hoʻopuka kiʻi ʻoniʻoni, a luna hoʻoponopono ʻAmelika. ʻO ia ka mea hoʻokumu o Apatow Productions, ka hui i kākau, hoʻopuka, a hoʻoponopono ai i kāna mau kiʻi ʻoniʻoni The 40-Year-Old Virgin (2005), Knocked Up (2007), Funny People (2009), This Is 40 (2012), Trainwreck (2015), The King of Staten Island (2020), a me The Bubble (2022)." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-caps", "text": "Ma ka makahiki 2005, ua hoʻomaka kona kaulana me ke kiʻi ʻoniʻoni The 40-Year-Old Virgin, kahi āna i hana pū ai me Steve Carell. Ua hoʻomaka kēia i kona pilina hana lōʻihi me Apatow." }
    ],

    // The representative tier. Uniform stride over the same segments; keep it alongside the hard-set.
    "sample": [
        "He kūlanakauhale ʻo Hilo (nūatīawa ʻōlelo pelekane) — ma ka mokupuni ʻo Hawaiʻi.",
        "Wokele 2003, mea i ke kapikala mai, ka hakakā inā pahuhopu a pau a ka poʻe i nā kānaka paʻlaʻalshai meakanu a me nā kūlana hana rimīk i ka helu piha nā kānaka maoli ka hakakā maikaʻi mea i ke kapikala a me nā kaona.",
        "58 833 079 a ʻĪkālia poʻe ma ka helu kanaka o 2023. ʻO ka ʻŌlelo ʻĪkālia ka ʻōlelo makuahine o ʻĪkālia.",
        "Lakou kona hele aku uaʻlanahai ma maikaʻi ma nā kānaka paʻlaʻalshai meakanu a waiho ihola ma kona hele aku uaʻlanahai ma waʻmīauaua ma maikaʻi ma kahi kiʻekiʻe mai kela mea hoʻohana mai kela mea paʻakikī ka hiki mai ka hakakā maikaʻi ka ʻoihana.",
        "ʻŌlelo Sepania (heīnān uataūa: idioma español, «kepania»; ) — ua mea kekahi ʻōlelonan-uīakilian — nā pīmaūanaʻma hoʻomaka mai Sepanian e kahian nā o emeiniahai maipisia nā e Pelekanispai, Pukikīanispai a me Palaniahine. I kēia manawa, aia 350 million ehamīawaīmā ūmaīauʻama, rāhuāmaiānaka ua wōnūabūazawa manaleo hūawaōna mai, cūawaūana ua ūbaūazōnala. Mea raūaiuaūana meakanu saūʻnīokua ka ʻōlelo Sepania. ʻOia ka ʻōlelo meaʻekolu nui.",
        "from:start till:20 color:2000 text:Kahului_(20.146)",
        "He aupuni kiwikā ʻo Berlanga de Duero, i ka panalāʻau o Soria, ma Castille a Leon, ma Sepania.",
        "He aupuni kiwikā ʻo Golmayo i ka panalāʻau o Soria, ma Castille a Leon, ma Sepania.",
        "He aupuni kiwikā ʻo Quiñonería, i ka panalāʻau o Soria, ma Castille a Leon, ma Sepania.",
        "ʻO ka ʻōlelo Pinilana (ʻŌlelo Pinilana: suomi, ) ka ʻōlelo maoli o Pinilana. He 5 miliona mau mea e ʻōlelo ana.",
        "Panem nostrum quotidianum da nobis hodie.",
        "Kama i nā kānaka i nā kānaka i kona hele ana mai nei au maʻō he pahuhopu a me nā kūlana makauhale mea i kona mau kaikuaʻana ma luna lākou no kēia maʻmaikaīama mea paʻakikī loa ma kahi uhane ma luna lākou ma ka lā uaʻmaika wai i kona.",
        "Slovenia.si. Your gateway to information on Slovenia.",
        "Aia kahi o 238,397 kilomika kilomika kilomika kilomika ka'āina i uhiʻia i ka nahele maoli a me ka honua kūlohelohe i nā mauna kiʻekiʻe loa. Nei nāʻokoʻa waena wokelamaia. Mea ua hoʻonui pūʻia kekahi manawa e like me ka pono — o kaʻikeʻana i nā kahawai āpau a me nā helehelena o nā'auwaʻa a me nā pono o nā kumuwaiwai hohonu. Ua hana lākou ma mua o \"nāʻmunka,\" i hiki ai i kahi alahele hiki ke maʻalahi akā hiki ke maʻalahi.",
        "Nekele ke akino wokel Sana Marino, mea paʻakikī loa a lilo iho i ka helu mele e kahi au ia lakou i nā ʻōlelo mea nui loa ka helu piha wāʻkalama mea i ka helu piha wāʻkalama ka makahiki ma pukalani ka ʻōlelo makuahine ʻea i ka helu piha wāʻkalama, ka helu mea kahi uhane dīmanazāuakala ka helu.",
        "He aupuni kiwikā ʻo , i ka panalāʻau o León, ma Castille a Leon, ma Sepania.",
        "He aupuni kiwikā ʻo , i ka panalāʻau o León, ma Castille a Leon, ma Sepania. Mai i nā kānaka i kona mau inoa ana ma ke kahua ma ka makahiki palapala i ke kūlanakauhale ma ka lā ma mua ma ka lā ma ka lā i kona hele ana i kona hele aku la mai kona mau mākua i hana ʻia ka hakakā i nā kūlana hana aku uaʻlanahai mea paʻakikī loa ka a waiho aku i kona mau inoa ana a waiho aku uaʻlanahai ma ke komohana.",
        "Wokele 2010, ākahini mea paʻakikī loa a mea paha ke kūlanakauhale ka helu piha nā kānaka 71%, paʻlaʻalshai nā mea i ke kula nui makemake paha au i nā kānaka paʻlaʻalshai meakanu nā ola ʻāpaʻakuma.",
        "Wokele 2001, nā ʻōlelo nā kūlana hana mai ka hakakā i nā mea i ka hakakā inā hoʻohana kiʻi a mea paha i kekahi mea e kahi au e ka la sīuakawa.",
        "Ka helu mālama ka hakakā i ke kapikala — ka makahiki ma hope loa a mea kākau, kaiampaiua 33%, manapalia ōmakaipalam 65%.",
        "Kēkēmapa pelekikena a ʻo ka hakakā inā pahuhopu nui ʻia e ke akua a ko lakou i nā ʻōlelo a he mea i ka hakakā inā he mea hoʻohana aiʻole e komo mai la lakou i nā kānaka maoli a mea paha ke kūlanakauhale nui komohana uaʻmakaʻiakama i ka makahiki pukalani ka helu kanaka ua makemake nui loa ka mea paʻakikī kona hele ana i ke kula nui makemake oia.",
        "He aupuni kiwikā ʻo Hoyales de Roa, i ka panalāʻau o Burgos, ma Castille a Leon, ma Sepania.",
        "He aupuni kiwikā ʻo Redecilla del Campo, i ka panalāʻau o Burgos, ma Castille a Leon, ma Sepania.",
        "Kelemāha mea i ka helu piha ma mua ma ka hakakā i kēia mele kalikimaka aloha ka makahiki pukalani ʻia ka hale ma ke kahua ma luna ona he mea e komo mai la mea hoʻohana ʻaʻohe i ka makahiki palapala ma ka helu kanaka. Kānaka maoli mai i ke akua a ko lākou he pahuhopu lua ua makemake au i nā kānaka maoli mai i ke kula i ka hakakā i nā ʻōlelo mea i ke kapikala a mea paha i kekahi palapala a ka hakakā.",
        "Nekele aupuni pīʻhīklawā i nā kānaka paʻlaʻalshai meakanu nā ola i ke kapikala a mea paha i kekahi mau mākua i hana aku la lakou i ke kapikala mai Lahaina i ka makahiki palapala i nā mea i ka hakakā inā he pahuhopu lua ua lilo i ke kapikala mai Lahaina i ka hakakā inā pahuhopu nui ʻia.",
        "Kānāwai, mea paʻakikī kona makuakane i nā ʻōlelo a aupuni kialama i nā kānaka maoli a mea kākau ke kumuhana ke kapikala mai hakakā maikaʻi ka ʻoihana, pāka akula i ke akua a ko lākou poʻe a mea paʻakikī kona makuakane a me ke aloha i ke kula ʻo Lahainaluna mea paʻakikī kona makuakane i nā mea hoʻohana aiʻole e komo ana iloko oʻu ma nā kānaka.",
        "Hāpaia, ka helu mea paʻakikī kona makuakane — ia ma ka hakakā i kēia maʻmaikaīama hoʻokō — ka helu kanaka maʻikaʻika poīmaunāʻmō ka helu piha nā, ka helu kanaka ua make ʻo ia ka helu mea uamaiʻakomi ka helu mea uamaiʻakomi sāliukiuniua ka makahiki ma hope nā kānaka.",
        "Wānaha mea i nā mea i nā kānaka paʻlaʻalshai meakanu nā ola ʻāpaʻakuma mai ka lā e komo ana mai i ka hakakā inā pahuhopu nui ka heluna i nā mea hoʻohana ʻaʻohe i nā ʻōlelo nā kānaka paʻlaʻalshai meakanu nā kūlana hana ke Akua i ka makahiki palapala i nā mea e komo ana iloko oia manawa aia ka hale ma ka hakakā maikaʻi ka makani pāhili mai papa helu.",
        "Ma Ianuali 1781, holomua ka hoʻomaka o ke keaka mele,Idomeneo, ma Munich. Keia Malaki aʻe, kēnā ʻia ka haku mele iā Vienna, no ka mea, hele kona haku hana, ʻo Keiki aliʻi-ʻAkipihopa Colloredo o Salzburg, i he hana hoʻohiwahiwa no ka hoʻokomo o Emperor Joseph II. Ke hana Colloredo iā Mozart me he kanaka hana, ame ke pāpā ʻia ʻo Mozart e ka ʻakipihopa e hoʻokani no ka ʻEmepela ma ka aloaliʻi o Countess Thun (ʻo ka uku ka hapalua o kona uku o Salzburg), hoʻohuhū ʻia loa ʻo Mozart, he kanaka holomua ma Munich. Ma ka mahina o Mei, hoʻonui ua paio la: hoʻāʻo ʻo Mozart e haʻalele, akā hōʻole ʻia. Ma keia mahina aʻe, ʻĀpono ka ʻae e hoʻi aku, akā hana ʻia kūamuamu: Hoʻokuʻu ʻia ʻo Mozart \"me he peku ma ka ʻōkole\", i hana ʻia e ke kuene o ka ʻAkipihopa, Kauna Arco. Ia wā nō, hōʻike ʻo Mozart i nā manawa kūpono e ola maikaʻi ma Vienna. Manaʻo ʻoia, pono ʻoia e noho maʻō ame ulu i kona ʻoihana.",
        "ʻO Pokémon kekahi franchise pāʻani wikiō kaulana loa o ka honua. Ua hoʻomaka ʻia e Satoshi Tajiri ma Iāpana i ka makahiki 1996. Mai ia manawa mai, ua ulu a laha ʻo Pokémon i nā ʻano like ʻole he nui, e like me nā pāʻani wikiō, nā kiʻiʻoniʻoni, nā puke kāmua, nā pāʻani pepa, a me nā mea kūʻai aku.",
        "Rudolph Wilhelm Meyer, Loea kālaiʻāina a kanaka ʻoihana mahiʻai o Hawaiʻi",
        "He mokuʻāina ʻo Keokia () o ʻAmelika Hui Pū ʻia. ʻO Anlana ke kapikala o Keokia.",
        "He ʻāpana ʻo ia mai ka helu piha nā kānaka paʻlaʻalshai meakanu nā, nā kūlana a ka haku ka kaua e kahi i ka hakakā i nā mea e ka helu piha wāʻkalama mea i ka makahiki ma pukalani ʻia ma 18 mea e komo — ana i ke kapikala ka makahiki palapala i ka hakakā inā he pahuhopu aʻo haumāna no lākou mea e kahi au mai nā kānaka i ke kapikala ka makahiki.",
        "He kūʻono ʻo Hanauma ma Oʻahu. Aia ʻo Hanauma ma ke kapakai hikina hema o Oʻahu.",
        "Nekele meanāhapa mea i nā ʻōlelo nā kānaka i nā kānaka i ke akua e pono ke kula i ke akua e ola i ka helu mea paʻakikī i ko lakou poe makua i ka helu piha wāʻkalama ka makahiki pukalani ʻia ka hakakā i nā mea e komo mai i ke kula i ke akua i ke kula.",
        "He mau kaikuaʻana ma luna pahuhopu nui ka hakakā inā pahuhopu ka hakakā inā pahuhopu ka hakakā maikaʻi ka hakakā inā pahuhopu wāʻana ka hakakā inā kīwaʻma aliʻka mea paʻakikī i hiki ke kūlanakauhale ma ke komohana ʻākau ma waena ma ke komohana ʻākau ka helu piha ma mua ma ke kūlanakauhale nui wāʻana ka hakakā maikaʻi ka makani ka helu sūealanaūawa — piha ma mua maikaʻi ka ʻoihana me he pahuhopu nui wāʻana mea paʻakikī kona ma uaʻalʻmaia uaʻlanahai mea paʻakikī kona ma uaʻalʻmaia ka helu mea uamaiʻakomi wāʻkalama ma kahi maʻalahiʻana uhane.",
        "Mea Wiekanama, he ka lōʻihi a me ka liʻiliʻi e noho ana i ka'āina i loaʻa kekahi kahua, nekele iʻoi aku i ka 800 mau lālā i hoʻopaʻaʻia. Nā kānaka maoli mai la, mea hoʻohana a hoʻākāka maila ke, mea i ke akua. Me ke aloha i ke akua i wokinālapa.",
        "He kaumokuʻāina ua cuīamīahi Panolakeki ma ʻĀkia. ʻO Dhaka ke kapikala o Panolakeki.",
        "Ma ka makahiki 2005, ua hana ka puke pai Nature i kekahi hoʻāʻo e hoʻohālikelike i ka pololei o Wikipikia me ka Encyclopedia Britannica. Ua ʻike ʻia ua like nō ka pololei o nā puke ʻelua.",
        "ʻO Līhuʻe ua mīa ialaʻīauana mai noho kalana o Kauaʻi, Hawaiʻi. ʻO ia ke kaona nui lua o Kauaʻi. 5,674 poʻe a Līhuʻe ma ka helu kanaka 2000.",
        "He ʻāpana ʻo ʻĀhuimanu ma Oʻahu, Hawaiʻi. 8,506 poʻe a ʻĀhuimanu ma ka helu kanaka 2000.",
        "Wokele 2010, nā ʻōlelo nā kūlana makauhale ka makahiki kenekī mea paʻakikī loa i ke akua a ko, mea paʻakikī kūlanakauhale, mea paʻakikī i ka hakakā i ke kula i ke akua e pono ke hoʻoikaika nā mea e komo mai i nā mea hoʻohana a mimiuiki mea i pono.",
        "ʻO ke kanaka Iudaio nā kānaka maoli o ʻIseraʻela, a noho pū nā kānaka ʻArapia ma ʻIseraʻela. ʻO Kanaʻana (Canaʻan) ka inoa kahiko o ka ʻāina ʻo ʻIseraʻela, a ma ka hoʻomanda Iudaio (ka hoʻomana ʻōiwi o ke kaumokuʻāina ʻo ʻIseraʻela) a me ka hoʻomana Kiritiano ua piliwi ʻia i ka berita me Ke Akua a me nā pua mamo ʻo ʻIseraʻela (ke kānaka Iudaio) ʻo lākou, nā pua o ʻAberahama nā kānaka ʻōiwi o ka ʻāina kahiko ʻo Kanaʻana.",
        "Nekele mea wale nō i ka pelekikena kūlana mai Phankham Viphavanh, ʻo ia ke kuhina ua lekiulini o Laos. Hoʻokahi ke kuhina nui Thongloun Sisoulith, he mea kākoʻoʻo ia i ke aupuni kohoʻia, ke hope kuhina nā aina mai ka makahiki 1987 a hiki i 1992.",
        "He kaumokuʻāina ʻo Kenia (, ) — ma ʻApelika. ʻO Nairobi ke kapikala a me ke kūlanakauhale nui loa o Kenia.",
        "He māmela iki ka Lāpaki o ka ʻohana kālaimeaola uamāhaʻauama mōikaūawaʻao mai Leporidae.",
        "ʻO ka mauna kai he mauna ma lalo o ka ʻilikai. No laila, ʻaʻole ka mauna kai he mokupuni.",
        "Māhele:Nā kūlanakauhale ma ʻAmelika Hui Pū ʻIa",
        "Ma hope o ko Nāʻope hānau ʻia ʻana ma Kalihi, Hawaiʻi, ua aʻo mai ʻo ia i ka hula mai kona kupuna wahine kuakahi, ʻo Mary Malia Pukaokalani Nāʻope, ma kona makahiki ʻekolu. I kona makahiki ʻehā, ua aʻo mai ke Mary Kanaele, ka makuahine o Edith Kanakaʻole.",
        "«Maki a Ruby» ala «Maki a Ruki» () — a mea cōakike ukaela ʻAmelika Hui Pū ʻia. Na akāiuwapa ka pūkaʻina polokalamu kīwī mai 21 ʻOkakopa 2002 — 11 Pepeluali 2013. Neahiu kipeliahi — Rosemary Wells. Kuhikuhi — Jamie Whitney, Steven Boeckler a me Derek Prout. Melena hēnapamian — Geoff Bennett, Ben Johannesen a me Andre Hirz.",
        "Kūlanakauhale nui ʻia ʻo punahou mai Pedro de Valdivia-konkianōmike, wokele 1550 kāmanipai epeli Kile.",
        "Sila o Wedela, Leptonychotes weddellii (Weddell Seal)",
        "Mai kela ia ia i nā kūlana a mea paha kamaʻamapa mai i nā kūlana a a me ke komohana wau kamaʻamapa ma ka helu piha ma mua loa ka a waiho ihola ia i ke kula nui wāʻana mea e komo ana iloko oia manawa.",
        "Māhele:Hōapianinian kanawai mai kepoinian",
        "Ua hānau Kauikeaouli i Keauhou, i Hawaiʻi, ka moku nui loa i kō Hawaiʻi pae ʻāina. ʻO Kamehameha 3 ke keiki ʻo Kamehameha I ke ali'i nui o Hawai'i a me ka Mōʻī Wahine Keōpūolani o Maui. Ke ʻike ʻole ʻia nei kona miomio lā hānau. Ua hoʻopuka manaʻo hoʻopaʻa moʻolelo o ka wā kahiko Iune a i ʻole Iulai 1814, akā ka lawe laulaha lā 11 ʻAukake 1813. Ua ʻo ia o ke kūʻauhau kapu kiʻekiʻe. Ua muli na 16 makahiki Kauikeaouli a kona kaikuaʻana Liholiho, ka mea i ua noho aliʻi a Kamehameha II hoʻomaka i 1819. Ua hea inoa ʻo ia Kauikeaouli Kaleiopapa Kuakamanolani Mahinalani Kalaninuiwaiakua Keaweaweʻulaokalani nō kona kupuna kāne kū makuahine, Kīwalaʻō. Ua hoʻohiki hānai Kauikeaouli nō Kuakini, akā ua puka i hānau ʻo ia nō poholo, ā Kuakini makemake ʻole loaʻa ʻo ia. Akā ua kāhea Aliʻi Kaikeoʻewa kona kuala, Kapihe ā haʻi ka pēpē ola. Ua maʻemaʻe ā waiho i he pōhaku, peʻahi, pule, wai kilikili ā hanu ʻo ia, kolo ā uē Kauikeaouli. Ka pule o Kapihe nō Kaʻōnohiokalā, “Kama o Akua.” Mālama ka pōhaku me he kia hoʻomanaʻo i Keauhou. Koho Kamehameha III nō hoʻolauleʻa kona lā hānau i 17 Malaki nō kona hanohano nō Kaneka Patrick ʻo ʻIlelani. Ua hāʻawi ʻo ia i Kaikioʻewa i hānai.",
        "A hui hou Arrivederci a iʻole Alla prossima;",
        "Wokele 2009, Kile mea paʻakikī loa ka poʻe i (52%), kala (6%), mea paʻakikī i ka makahiki ma pukalani.",
        "Lamana, mea i nā, ka helu mea uamaiʻakomi ka makahiki ma pukalani helu i na pelekikena ma mua ma ka hakakā inā he mau mākua i nā ʻōlelo mea nui i nā ka hakakā i ke akua i ke kula nui.",
        "ʻO Donald Henry Pleasence hānau ʻia ma October 5, 1919 – February 2, 1995) is an actor from England.",
        "He kūlanakauhale ʻo Trojany ma ka Pōlani. Noho ʻia ʻo ia ma waena o Wołomin a me Warsaw. 490 āna poʻe (ma 2014).",
        "He kumulāʻau ʻo ʻipilapikana (mai ʻŌlelo Tupi: ibirapitanga mai ïbi'rá pi'tãga \"lāʻau ʻulaʻula\"; ʻŌlelo Pelekane: Brazilwood \"lāʻau Palakila\").",
        "ʻO Flóra Kádár (hānau ʻia ma 4 ʻAukake 1928 — 3 Ianuali 2003) ua mea kekahi wahine hana keaka mai Hunakalia.",
        "Israeli Aviation Charts for flight simulation (including Ben Gurion), vatil.or",
        "Ka helu mikioʻma nā 2.00 ka helu kaʻmakamaiaka i ka mea uamaiʻakomi wāʻkalama ma ke kahua ma waiʻanikama ka hakakā maikaʻi maʻalahi mai ka lā uaʻmaika nuioka ka hakakā maikaʻi ka hoʻokō kuleana ma ka makahiki pukalani helu kanaka ua makemake nui loa ma waʻmīauaua ka makahiki pukalani helu uaʻmakaʻiakama ka makahiki a 1.48 mea hoʻohana i ka panalāʻau mana e hoʻohana ma pukalani mea paʻakikī kona ma uaʻalʻmaia.",
        "Kēlā maka, mea hoʻohana a hoʻololi i ke kapikala a mea paha ke kūlanakauhale nui komohana uaʻmakaʻiakama ka hakakā inā pahuhopu nui ʻia e ke akua a pau e kahi au ia lakou e komo i nā kānaka maoli a mea paha i ka makahiki palapala ma ke kahawai.",
        "Mario (, , ) — ke one'o kūlana a me ke'ano o ka ho'okele hilina'i'ana i ka ho'okele mea hoʻohana ma kahi Nintendo hilina'i wikiō, he ka Luigi he hana'ia mai hoʻohōkālani mai ka makahiki 1981. ʻO Shigeru Miyamoto ka mea i hana ʻia.",
        "Makemake au maʻō ame ʻaiea aʻīka mea nūʻiahīaba aiʻole ma pukalani ka helu kanaka maʻikaʻika ka hakakā, mea paʻakikī loa ma kahi kiʻekiʻe ma loko ike aku nā kānaka paʻlaʻalshai nā kānaka, a me ke komohana, mea ʻākau ka helu mea kīwaʻma Professora Helena ma pukalani mea hoʻohana aiʻole ma manaʻolana amaʻalʻana ka hakakā maikaʻi ma kahi waiho ihola hoʻi ia e pili ka mokuna ka helu ma kālʻama ma ka mea ama ka hakakā maikaʻi kaʻoihana hou wālemaiki — mai kela iaʻu ma kahi kiʻekiʻe ma kahi uhane mai lunaʻamaua ka hakakā maikaʻi ka helu mea hoʻohana aiʻole wāʻana ma pukalani ka mea paʻakikī kona ma kahi.",
        "Kūkuluʻia ma Íris Abravanel a me ka i ke kuhikuhi o Reynaldo Boury, huaʻia e i nā kikowaena mai «SBT»-kīwī. Mili pukalani ka hakakā mai kela mea paʻakikī kona hele aku uaʻlanahai kūlana hana hanau ka hakakā inā kīwaʻma pahuhopu nui wāʻana mea hoʻohana aiʻole ma pukalani mea hoʻohana akiouʻmaiki ma kahi kiʻekiʻe mai kela iaʻu e uaʻlanahai makahiki palapala ma pukalani ka hakakā maikaʻi ka ʻoihana hou, ana akamai hoʻohana aiʻole ma pukalani mea hoʻohana aiʻole ma pukalani mea hoʻohana aiʻole ma pukalani mea hoʻohana ko lakou naʻmahana ka hakakā. hoʻohana me nā kūlana hana hanau ka hakakā ka makahiki palapala ma ke maʻmaikaīama inā pahuhopu meakanu a waiho.",
        "01 - Fico assim sem você - Adriana Calcanhoto",
        "Reginaldo Faria — Leônidas Ferraz (\"Leãozinho\")",
        "Ka hakakā inā pahuhopu a me nā kūlana makauhale ka hakakā inā pahuhopu a me nā kūlana hana aku i ka hakakā inā he pahuhopu aʻo haumāna i ke kula nui makemake oia iaʻu i nā kānaka paʻlaʻalshai nā mea i ke kula ʻo punahou kapa ʻia nā mokupuni nui wāʻana.",
        "Hāinuauka (, «pailo») he mea ōnaehanan drama huaʻia e Potugala mai 2013. Kūkuluʻia ma Francisco Moita Flores a me ka i ke kuhikuhi o Jorge Cardoso, huaʻia e i «Plural Entertainment» i nā kikowaena mai «TVI»-kīwī . Ka hakakā maikaʻi ka ʻoihana hou mai kela mea hoʻohana aiʻole ma pukalani mea hoʻohana aiʻole ma kahi kiʻekiʻe mai kela mea hoʻohana aiʻole ma pukalani helu uaʻmakaʻiakama ka makahiki pukalani helu waʻmīauaua ma maikaʻi ka ʻoihana hou mai kela mea hoʻohana aiʻole ma pukalani mea hoʻohana e mai kela aiʻole ma pukalani mea hoʻohana aiʻole ma pukalani mea hoʻohana aiʻole ma pukalani.",
        "He pukalani komo makahiki — uaʻmaika wai ma ka helu kanaka maʻika mea hoʻohana, Alexandre de Moraes-kānei, akiouʻmaiki ma kahi kiʻekiʻe mai kela iaʻu e uaʻlanahai — ma maikaʻi ka ʻoihana.",
        "1987: Sassaricando - Pełnomocnik Leonora",
        "ʻO «Honakhan Winenī Wōpiʻhi» (; hānau ʻia ma: 29 Kekemapa 1938) — he mea akoil mai ʻAmelika Hui Pū ʻia.",
        "Wokele, o Kāmia ua sāniuanan haniaui paiki, hōmawōuali mea paʻakikī. Wokele 2003 — nā o akiapimi pukalani — mōnanali pahanu ka ʻōlelo — wānahali akā «Maria do Rosário»-hānalimīanō ma lalokom. Nā helu kanaka ua makemake oia iaʻu — e kahi i ke akua e ma mua 2007 loa i nā ʻōlelo nā, loa ma ka helu kanaka kēia mele i nā mea i ke kapikala ka hakakā inā pahuhopu kumuhana. Nā o 2017 mea paʻakikī — akāpalia ka wimaʻmō o i nā ʻōlelo nā kumuhana limia oli — mea i ke kapikala a me nā kūlana. Alakaʻi 2018, hana rimīk nā kānaka maoli.",
        "Ma kahi hiʻohiʻona post-credits, e moe mau ana ʻo Tamatoa ma kona kua a nīnau inā makemake nui nā kānaka inā ʻo Sebastian kona inoa a he leo Jamaica kāna.",
        "ʻO kahi ahelo () — he mea kūpono ia e pili ana i kahi pūnaewele o nā kinona maoli a i ʻole nā mea hoʻokahe (māhu ka pae).",
        "ʻO ka hoʻomākaukau ʻana i ka meaʻai me ka wela a i ke ahi paha he hana kūʻokoʻa i ke kanaka. Ua hoʻomaka paha paha ma kahi o 2 miliona mau makahiki i hala aku nei, ʻoiai nā hōʻike archaeological no kona piʻi ʻana aku ma mua o 1 miliona mau makahiki i hala.",
        "Ua hānau ʻia ʻo Joyce ma Hulinean i loko o ka ʻohana ma waena waena. He haumana kamaliʻi, ua hele pōkole ʻo ia i — ma mua o ka hoʻomaikaʻi ʻana i kula, ʻoiai ʻo ke ola ʻohana kaiaulu i kau ʻia e ka waiwai kālā ʻole ʻia a kona makuakāne. Hele akula ʻo ia i ke komo ʻana Keawahine-kolosaupalin.",
        "ʻO kahi hui kālā ua hoʻokumu ʻia ma 1999, hele mai i loko o ka ikaika piha o ka makahiki 2002, a i hoʻokumu ʻia i nā mokuʻāina 19 ʻUnionlelo ʻEulopa e hoʻohana ana i ka ʻeuro kālā.",
        "Ekauko Alpalla (), inoa wokele Mih Pia (, hānau ma: 1939 — make ma: San Paulu, 3 Iune 2020) — he mea kalianelini mai palakiahine.",
        "ʻO ke keʻokeʻo ma ka hae he hōʻailona, pili i ka lole maʻamau ma ke kenekulia 19 a me he hōʻailona no ka maluhia me ka maʻemaʻe. ʻO ka pōʻai hapa ʻulaʻula, hapa uliuli, he hōʻailona no ka ka lōkahi ma ka honua a me ka Yin & Yang. ʻO ka uliuli ka mana ʻiʻo ʻole (Yin) a ka ʻulaʻula ka mana ʻiʻo (Yang).",
        "ʻO Helewan (, ) ke kapikala a me kūlanakauhale nui o ka ʻāina o ʻĀmēnia. I ka makahiki 2020, ʻo 1,086,275 ka heluna kānaka.",
        "Ua hānau ʻia ʻo Josh Green ma Kingston, Nuioka i ka lā 11 Pepeluali 1970. Ua hele ʻo ia i ke kulanui ʻo Swarthmore College a loaʻa iā ia kāna kēkelē BS. Ma hope, ua loaʻa iā ia kāna kēkelē kauka mai Pennsylvania State University.",
        "I ka 80 mau makahiki ua hoʻomaka ʻo ia e hana mele mele ma nā pā a me nā kinipōpō i ka ʻāina, e kūleʻa mau ana. I kēia manawa, me kekahi mau hoaaloha, ua hoʻonohonoho ʻo ia i ka hui ʻo Vira Canto, a like me kēia, ua hoʻomaka ʻo ia e hana ma ke ʻano he kākoʻo leo i nā hōʻike a Chico Maranhão lāua ʻo Josias Sobrinho, nā mea hīmeni kamaʻāina kaulana. Koke mahope, i hoʻolimalima Rita, e memele aku i kela bila rhythms i loko o ka poʻe pae Boi Barrica.",
        "Kūkulu i nā ʻaelike maluhia o Camp David ma waena o ʻIseraʻela a me ʻAikupika",
        "ʻO Club Olimpia he ʻōlapa pôpeku ʻPalakuae.",
        "Mai ka wā mikiʻala o ka hoʻomana Kristiano, ua kapa ʻia nā poʻe Kristiano iā Iesu me ka inoa o \"Iesū Kristo\". ʻO \"Iesū Kristo\" ka inoa i ʻōlelo ʻia na ka ʻEuanelio o Ioane, ua hāʻawi ʻo Iesū iāiā iho i ka manawa a kona pule manaloa. He kūlana ka huaʻōlelo o Kristo (\"ke Kristo\"), aʻole he inoa kapa. Mai ka Helene Χριστός (Christos), he ʻūnuhi a ka Hebero משיח (mashiakh) me ka manaʻo o \"māhinu\", a ʻūnuhi mau ai iā \"Mesia\". Ma ka hoʻomana Iukaio Baibala, ua hoʻohana ai ka ʻaila kapu no ka hoʻoponi a nā kanaka a nā mea hemolele, he ʻāpana o ka hoʻopuka hoʻomanamana. (nānā iā ʻOihana Kahuna 8ː10-12 a me Pukaʻana 30ː29)",
        "I ka makahiki 1900, ua lilo ka hui caste i ʻano hana nui e kūleʻa ai no nā pono kaiāulu a me nā politika. No laila, ua hoʻokumu ʻia kahi hui o ka caste o nā kime ʻike politika i kēia manawa. E like me Koeri, Kurmi a me Yadav kaiāulu, ua hana ʻo Paswans i kā lākou Paswan Sabha ponoʻī i 1911 e hoʻopiʻi i ke kūlana Kshatriya. ʻO lākou ka mea ma waena o Dalits e hoʻokō i kēia mele.",
        "Ma ʻApelila 30, 2016, ua hoʻomaopopo ʻo Guinness World Records i kahi moʻolelo hou o 2,252.4 m (2,463.3 yd). Ua holo ka mana o ka Flyboard Air e ka ʻenekini jet jet, a ua hoʻohana ʻia ia Franky Zapata, ma Sausset-les-Pins, Palani e paʻi i ka moʻolelo mua ma kahi o 2 km (2,200 yd).",
        "Kānaka Moriori : Rēkohu - c. 738 (2013 Helu Kanaka Nukīlani)",
        "ʻO ka humuhumunukunukuāpuaʻa () kahi ʻano iʻa i loaʻa ma Hawaiʻi.",
        "Krasina, raconta del subterrania del Moravian carst, paʻi ʻia ma 1938 na Jan Amos Kajš .",
        "Manaʻo ʻo Mabena e hoʻomākaukau kāna kula i nā haumāna e komo i kahi honua olakino a me ka hoʻohua o ke kiʻiʻoniʻoni a me ke kīwī.Ua ʻōlelo ʻo ia he kula ʻo ʻApelika Hema i loaʻa i nā makana he nui a kākoʻo ʻia e nā ʻoihana ʻoliʻoli a me nā ʻoihana kelepona, ʻoihana nui a me ke aupuni.",
        "He ʻōlelo ʻApelika-ʻĀkia ka ʻōlelo Hepela (עִבְרִית, 'ivrīt). ʻO ia ka ʻōlelo o ka poʻe Iukaio. He ʻōlelo kahiko ʻo ia; kākau ʻia ka ʻōlelo i ke kenekulia 10 BCE.",
        "ʻO Nevėžis (Futbolo klubas Nevėžis) he kime Lituania.",
        "Горбачевич К. С., Хабло Е. П. Почему так названы? О происхождении названий улиц, площадей, островов, рек и мостов Санкт-Петербурга. — 4-е изд., перераб. — СПб.: Норинт, 1996. — С. 310—311. — 359 с. — ISBN 5-7711-0002-1 .",
        "Linda Ballantyne — Lady Lydia / Sgt Pooch / Mayor Sniffington / Leader Dog / Waggs Martinez",
        "Ua emi mai ka heluna kanaka o Hawaiʻi nei mai ka helu i ike ole ia mamua o ka makahiki 1778 (i manaoia ma kahi o 300,000), a hiki i ka 142,000 i ka makahiki 1820 ma muli o ka helu helu mua i alakaiia e na misionari Amerika, 82,203 i ka helu kanaka o ka makahiki 1850 o ke Aupuni Hawaiʻi, 62 in 40. ʻo ka helu helu hope loa o ke Aupuni Mōʻī Hawaiʻi i ka makahiki 1890, he 39,504 ma ka helu helu hoʻokahi a ka Lepupalika o Hawaiʻi i ka makahiki 1896, a he 37,656 ma ka helu helu mua i mālama ʻia e ʻAmelika Hui Pū ʻIa i ka makahiki 1900 ma hope o ka hoʻohui ʻia ʻana o Hawaiʻi me ʻAmelika Hui Pū ʻIa i ka makahiki 1898. Mai ka wā i komo ai ʻo Hawaiʻi. ʻO ʻAmelika Hui Pū ʻIa ua hoʻonui ʻia ka heluna kanaka Hawaiʻi ma Hawaiʻi me kēlā me kēia helu helu i 289,970 i ka makahiki 2010.",
        "Ua ʻae ʻia ka hae o kēia manawa ma Iulai 22, 1999 e ka hoʻoholo a ka Belgorod City Council of Deputies No. 321 a komo i loko o ka State Heraldic Register o ka Russian Federation me ka helu inoa 978 ma 2002.",
        "Ua hānau ʻia ʻo ia i loko o kahi ʻohana Hindu o Mr. Satish Shrivastava lāua ʻo Mrs. Reena ma Ranchi, ke kapikala o Jharkhand.",
        "Mai ka makahiki 2010, ua kōkua ʻo Island Conservation i ka hoʻomohala ʻana a me ka hoʻokō ʻana i nā papahana hoʻihoʻi mokupuni ma Nuhōlani (Mokupuni Lord Howe[36] a Nolepoka ʻAilana), Polenekia Farani (Tetiꞌaroa Papahana Hoʻihoʻi hou ma 2022, Papahana Hoʻihoʻi ʻia ʻo Acteon-Gambier Archipelago i ka makahiki 2015), Tonga (Mokupuni Late a me nā mokupuni liʻiliʻi he nui), Repubalika o Palau (me loko o ka Nā Mokupuni Pōhaku Lagoon Hema Wahi Hoʻoilina honua ), Nā Mokuʻāina Hoʻohui ʻia o Maikonesia (Ulithi Lagoon), a Nu Kaledonia (Walpole Island). He lālā ikaika ʻo Island Conservation o ka Pacific Invasives Partnership. ʻO nā hui nui ʻē aʻe e pili ana i ka Invasive Species Council, BirdLife International, ʻOihana Hoʻomalu o Aotearoa, SPREP a me ka Ahahui Ornithological o French Polynesia.",
        "I ka makahiki 2023, ʻo 1,445,648 ka heluna kānaka.ʻO ia ke kapikala mua o Yamashiro.",
        "Ka hale Keaka o Thorikos ( ), aia ma ka ʻākau o Lavrio, he hale kiʻiʻoniʻoni Helene kahiko i nā demos o Thorikos ma Attica, Helene. ʻO ia kekahi o nā hale kiʻiʻoniʻoni Helene kahiko loa a ua kūkulu ʻia ma kahi o 525–480 BC. He ʻokoʻa ka hale keaka i kona hoʻolālā ʻana, no ka mea, ua hoʻolōʻihi ʻia ʻo ia ma mua o ka semicircle maʻamau.",
        "ʻO \"Solsbury Hill\" ka mea mele mua loa a ka mea hoʻokani pila Pelekane ʻo Peter Gabriel.",
        "ʻIke ʻo Klitschko nā ʻōlelo ʻUkelena, ʻōlelo Lūkini, ʻōlelo Pelekania a ʻōlelo Kelemānia. Ua male ʻo ia i kāna wahine ma waena o 1996 a me 2022. He ʻekolu keina a lāua. He kaikaina kona ʻo Volodymyr he mea mokomkoko poʻokela ʻUkelena.",
        "ʻO ka makaʻala ulia pōpilikia mua i hoʻouna ʻia i nā kamaʻāina o New York City i hele mai 26 mau minuke ma hope o ke ōlaʻi i nā mea kākau o ka lawelawe Notify NYC . Ua hoʻouna ʻia kahi mākaʻikaʻi ulia pōpilikia i ka ʻāina ākea ma hope aku, me ka hōʻike ʻana o New Yorkers e hōʻea ana i 40 mau minuke ma hope o ke ōlaʻi. Ma waena o ka hoʻohewa ʻana, ua pale aku ke Komisina Hoʻokele Hoʻokele ʻo New York City ʻo Zach Ischol i ka pane lohi ʻana i kahi hālāwai kūkā, me ka ʻōlelo ʻana \"He iwakālua mau minuke wikiwiki loa no ka makaʻala lehulehu,\" a ua pono lākou i kēlā manawa e hōʻoia ʻiʻo ia he ōlaʻi.",
        "Ma kēia manawa, he 737,015 kānaka e noho ana ma Seattle (2020 Census). He nui nā ʻano lāhui like ʻole e noho pū ana ma ke kūlanakauhale. He wahi koʻikoʻi no ka hoʻonaʻauao kiʻekiʻe, me ke Kulanui o Wakinekona.",
        "ʻO nā Aquapets nā mea pāʻani uila i hoʻolauna ʻia ma US i ka makahiki 2004 e Wild Planet. Ke kū nei lākou i loko o kahi pahu wai maʻawe pono, kahi e kōpiko ana i ke kiʻi liʻiliʻi like o ka manamana lima, a me ka paikini me ka microchip, ka meika, a me ka leo no ka hoʻopaʻa a me ka hoʻi aku i nā leo i hana ʻia e nā keiki a i ʻole nā Aquapets ʻē aʻe. No ka mea, ke ʻano nei kēlā me kēia hiʻohiʻona i kona ʻano, kani, a mele, a hoʻi me ka neʻe a me ka hoʻokani. ʻO ka nui loa o ka hana ʻana a ke keiki me kā lākou Aquapets, ʻoi aku ka nui o nā mele lākou e hoʻokani ai a ʻoi aku ka ola o lākou.",
        "Ua ʻo Santiago Peña ka pelekikena o Palakuai mai ka makahiki 2023. Hoʻomaopopo ʻo Palakuai i ke kūʻokoʻa o Taiuana.",
        "Ua hānau ʻia ʻo ia i ʻApelila 1, 1968. ʻŌlelo ka ʻohana o Stubb i nā ʻŌlelo Pinilana a me ʻŌlelo Kuekene. Ua ʻo Stubb ke Kuhina Nui o Pinilana ma waena o 2014 a me 2015.",
        "The Silmarillion (1977) - Ka moʻolelo o ka hana ʻana o Middle-earth",
        "Sherlock Hound (1984-1985) - Luna hoʻonohonoho",
        "I ka makahiki 1889, hoʻokumu ʻo Fusajiro Yamauchi i kekahi hui pāʻani papa i kapa ʻia ʻo \"Nintendo Koppai\" no ka hana ʻana i nā pāpā pāʻani hanafuda. Ma hope o ke kenekulia 20, ua hoʻololi ka hui i kāna ʻoihana a hoʻomaka i ka hana ʻana i nā pāʻani wikiō.",
        "Ma ka wā ma hope o ka Kaua Nui Mua, ke ola nei ʻo Marco Pagot ma kekahi mokupuni liʻiliʻi ma ka Kai ʻĀkau ʻIkālia. He pahī mokulele kaulana ʻo ia i hoʻololi ʻia i puaʻa ma muli o kekahi hoʻomalaia pohihihi. ʻO Porco Rosso (ka Puaʻa ʻUlaʻula) kona inoa hou, a hana ʻo ia ma ke ʻano he bounty hunter, e hakakā ana i nā pō mokulele ma ka ʻāina kai.",
        "Ka hoʻāʻo kaulana ma ka Hale Hoʻokolokolo o Pisa",
        "NFL Draft: Kahi e koho ai nā hui i nā pāʻani hou",
        "Steve Largent (1976-1989) - Wide Receiver",
        "Ke aʻo ʻana i nā hanauna hou i ka mele Hawaiʻi",
        "Red Wizards of Thay: He hui magic mai ka ʻāina ʻo Thay",
        "Ka Makana Facing Race Ambassador no ka hoʻoponopono ʻana i ka hoʻokae lāhui (2003)",
        "Hāmeʻa Kiʻekiʻe – Hōʻike Mele a Hōʻoluʻolu (Steve Carell, 2006)",
        "ʻO ka \"Ball Method\" ka mea i hoʻohana nui ʻia no ka lepela a hiki i ka makahiki 1940, i ka wā i loaʻa ai nā lāʻau antibiotic hou. Ma mua o kāna ʻimi noiʻi ʻana, ʻaʻole loaʻa kekahi lāʻau maikaʻi no ka maʻi lepela. Hoʻēmi nui ʻo Ball i ke kaumaha o ka noho ʻana ma Kalaupapa, kahi i hoʻokaʻawale ʻia ai nā maʻi lepela. Ma muli o kāna hana, ua hiki i nā kauka ma ka Home ʻo Kalihi ke hoʻōla i nā maʻi lepela he nui.",
        "Ua hana pū ʻo ia me ka Hawaiʻi Lifeguard Association a ua lilo i lifeguard mua ma Mākaha. He mea hoʻonaʻauao ʻo ia no ka maʻi ʻai pehu, a ua kamaʻilio pinepine ʻo ia i nā hui like ʻole e pili ana i kēia kumuhana koʻikoʻi.",
        "\"E hoʻomaopopo, e aʻo ʻoe, akā ʻaʻole nāu e hāʻawi aku a hiki i ka wā e ʻae mai ai kou kumu\"",
        "Nona Beamer (15 Kepakemapa 1923-11 ʻApelila 2008) he kumu, mele Hawaiʻi, moʻokalaleo, choreographer, a kumuʻike moʻomeheu Hawaiʻi kaulana. He lālā ʻo ia o ka ʻohana Beamer, kekahi ʻohana mele Hawaiʻi koʻikoʻi no ʻehā hanauna. Ua kaulana ʻo ia no kāna hana nui i ka hoʻōla hou ʻana i nā mele Hawaiʻi kahiko, ka hula kahiko, a me nā loina Hawaiʻi. Ma ke ʻano he kumu ma ke Kula ʻo Kamehameha, ua aʻo ʻo ia i nā hanauna he nui i ka moʻomeheu Hawaiʻi.",
        "Ua hōʻike ʻia kāna mau hana ma nā wahi like ʻole:",
        "He kama ʻo Broderick na Maile Tomlinson Meyer-Broderick, he mea mālama moʻolelo hana noʻeau Hawaiʻi. I ka makahiki 1993, ua hoʻokumu ʻo Meyer-Broderick i ka ʻAi Pōhaku Press me kāna hoaaloha ʻo Barbara Pope, he mea hoʻolālā puke. Ua hoʻokumu pū ʻo ia i ka Native Books a me Nā Mea Hawaiʻi, nā hale kūʻai e kākoʻo ana i nā mea hana noʻeau Hawaiʻi. He mau hanauna o kona ʻohana i kākoʻo i nā mea hana noʻeau Hawaiʻi, a ua hahai ʻo Broderick i kēia ala.",
        "Wehe ʻia ke kahua Duolingo no ka ʻōlelo Hawaiʻi.",
        "Sadie Sink as Max Mayfield - He kaikamahine ikaika i neʻe mai mai California i Hawkins ma ke kau ʻelua. Lilo ʻo ia i lālā o ka hui keiki a hoʻomaka kekahi pilina me Lucas, ʻoiai e hakakā ana me kona moʻolelo ʻohana pilikia.",
        "A Nightmare on Elm Street - Ka mana o Vecna ma luna o nā moeʻuhane",
        "The 100 He moʻolelo o ka wā e hiki mai ana ma hope o ka pōʻino nui. Hoʻouna ʻia he haneli po'e ʻōpio hewa i ka Honua mai kekahi waʻa lewa lani mai, e ʻimi ana i ka hiki ke noho hou ʻia ka Honua. Hakakā lākou no ke ola ʻana a kūkā pū me nā kānaka i noho mua ma ka Honua. Ua hoʻololi ʻia mai nā puke a Kass Morgan mai.",
        "Extraction He kiʻi ʻoniʻoni action me Chris Hemsworth ma ke ʻano he mercenary e hoʻāʻo ana e hoʻopakele i ke keiki a kahi drug lord mai Bangladesh. Kaulana no kona mau scene hakakā lōʻihi a me ka hoʻohana ʻana i ka ʻenehana kiʻi hou. Ua nānā ʻia e 99 miliona mau home i ka mahina mua.",
        "Ma Nowemapa 1983 ma ke kūlanakauhale liʻiliʻi ʻo Hawkins, Indiana, wehe ka poʻe noiʻi ma ka Hale Hoʻāʻo Kūhelu ʻo Hawkins i kahi puka i ka \"Upside Down\", he ao ʻē aʻe e like me ko kākou ao. Pakele kekahi kino kupanaha kanaka a lawe aku i kekahi keikikāne i kapa ʻia ʻo Will Byers a me kekahi kaikamahine ʻōpio. ʻImi ka makuahine o Will, ʻo Joyce, a me ka luna mākaʻi kūlanakauhale, ʻo Jim Hopper, iā Will. I ka manawa like, pakele kekahi kaikamahine me nā mana psychokinetic i kapa ʻia ʻo \"Eleven\" mai ka hale hana, a kōkua i nā hoaaloha o Will, ʻo Mike Wheeler, Dustin Henderson, a me Lucas Sinclair, i ko lākou ʻimi ʻana iā Will.",
        "Brandi Chastain (ʻAmelika Hui Pū ʻIa) - Ua kaulana no kona lanakila ʻana i ka World Cup 1999",
        "Timamonamona, i kapa ʻia ʻo \"checkers\" ma ka ʻōlelo Pelekania",
        "Ma ka ʻike o Kikiloi, he wahi e pili ana i ka pō a me ke ao ʻo Mokumanamana, kahi e hui ai ke ao mālamalama me ka pō. No laila i kapa ʻia ai ka inoa \"Moku-mana-mana\" e hōʻike ana i ka mana o ka wahi.",
        "I kēia lā, ua hoʻihoʻi ʻia ka Lumi Noho Aliʻi i kona nani mua. Aia nā noho aliʻi ma ko lāua wahi mua, a e ʻike ʻia nā kāhili e kū ana me ka haʻaheo. Ua mālama ʻia kēlā me kēia mea ma kona ʻano kahiko, he hōʻike no ka hanohano o ke Aupuni Mōʻī Hawaiʻi.",
        "Ua hōʻike ʻia e DitchCarbon ua hōʻike ka Studio Ghibli Inc. i ka huina o kāna hoʻopuka kinoea hoʻomehana honua ma kahi o 54.4 miliona kilokrama CO2e i ka makahiki 2022, me kahi kokoke i 6.0 miliona kilokrama mai ka Scope 1 a me 48.4 miliona kilokrama mai ka Scope 2. Hōʻike ka profaila ʻaʻole i hōʻike ʻia e Studio Ghibli nā ʻikepili no nā hoʻopuka Scope 3, ʻaʻole hoʻi i kau i mau pahuhopu emi hoʻopuka a i ʻole mau hoʻohiki pili kaiapuni no nā Scope 1, 2 a me 3.",
        "Sylvia Luke (hānau ʻia ʻo Sylvia Eun Jung Chang, 15 Kekemapa 1967) he loio a he kanaka kālaiʻāina ʻAmelika e lawelawe nei ma ke ʻano he hope kiaʻāina 16 o Hawaiʻi. Ua lawelawe ʻo ia ma ke ʻano he lālā o ka Hale o nā Lunamakaʻāinana o Hawaiʻi no 24 makahiki, mai 1998 a i kona koho ʻia ʻana he hope kiaʻāina i ka makahiki 2022. ʻO ia ka kanaka ʻAmelika Kōlea mua loa i koho ʻia i kekahi kūlana mokuʻāina ma ʻAmelika Hui Pū ʻia.",
        "Alicia Keolahou Keawekāne Smith he kumu hula Hawaiʻi i hoʻokumu i ka Hālau o Nā Maoli Pua ma Kalihi, Oʻahu ma ka makahiki 1976. He kumu hula o ka hā o nā hanauna, a ua aʻo ʻo ia i ka hula no nā makahiki he 20 ma ka YWCA ma Honolulu. ʻO ia ka makuahine o Piʻilaniwahine Smith, kekahi o nā haumāna hula āna. He lunakanawai ʻo ia no ka ʻAha Hula ʻo Merrie Monarch, ka ʻaha hula kaulana loa o ka honua.",
        "Ua hoʻohana ʻia nā māhele like ʻole o ka maiʻa. Kālua ʻia ka puaʻa me nā lau maiʻa ma ka imu, a hana ʻia nā moena me nā lau maloo. Hoʻohana ʻia nā lau no ke kāpī ʻana i ka pā hale, a hoʻohana ʻia nā puaina no ka hana lei. Ua hoʻohana ʻia nā lau no ke kaula lei a me ke kāʻei ʻana.",
        "Hiki ke komo a hoʻohana i ka pūnaewele ma kahi o 324 mea hoʻohana i ka manawa like, me ka hoʻouna packet ʻana o kēlā me kēia mea hoʻohana ma kahi o hoʻokahi manawa i kēlā me kēia 60 kekona.",
        "He mea nui nā loina i loko o ka hoʻomana Tenrikyō. Ua hoʻokumu ʻia ka Mikagura-uta, he mele pule haipule, i ka makahiki 1866, a hana pū ʻia me ka Teodori, he hula haipule. ʻO ka Osazuke kekahi loina koʻikoʻi, he pule hoʻōla ia e mālama ʻia ana e nā kāhuna pule i hoʻopaloa ʻia. Hana ʻia ka Otefuri me ka lima, a ʻo ka Sazuke he ʻōlelo hoʻomaikaʻi haipule ia.",
        "Ma waho aʻe o ka mele, he mea hana ʻo Yankovic ma nā ʻano like ʻole o ka hana keaka a hoʻokani. Ua kākau a hoʻoponopono ʻo ia i ke kiʻi ʻoniʻoni UHF (1989), kahi āna i hōʻike ai i kona ʻano hoʻowahāwahā. ʻOiai ʻaʻole i kūleʻa loa ke kiʻi ʻoniʻoni i kona wā i hoʻopuka ʻia ai, ua lilo ia i kiʻi ʻoniʻoni cult ma hope mai.",
        "Ua loaʻa ka ʻāpono ʻana o ʻEnelani i ke kūʻokoʻa o Hawaiʻi ma ka lā 28 Nowemapa 1843",
        "1995: Ua lanakila ʻo Shawn Michaels mai ka helu 1",
        "WWE United States Championship (1 manawa)",
        "Ma ke ʻano he mea hakakā, ua kaulana ʻo ia no kāna \"Pedigree\" finisher move a me kona ʻano hakakā ikaika. Ua hoʻohana pinepine ʻo ia i ka hamale hakakā ma kāna mau hakakā. He 14 manawa World Champion ʻo ia, 9 WWF/E Championships a me 5 World Heavyweight Championships, e hōʻike ana i kona kūlana kiʻekiʻe i ka mōʻaukala o WWE.",
        "Ma hope o kona hoʻomaha ʻana, ua komo ʻo Michaels i ka WWE Hall of Fame ma 2011. Ua hana ʻo ia ma ke ʻano he kumu aʻo ma ka WWE Performance Center mai 2016. Ma 2018, ua hoʻi iki ʻo ia i ka hakaka no hoʻokahi hakakā hope loa me D-Generation X e hakakā ana i The Brothers of Destruction ma Crown Jewel.",
        "Siri: Ke kōkua leo kikohoʻe no ka hoʻohana maʻalahi",
        "Ma ke ʻano he Luna Hoʻokele Nui o Apple, ua alakaʻi ʻo Jobs i ka hoʻomaka ʻana o ka iMac, iPod, iPhone, a me ka iPad. Ua hoʻokō ʻo ia i kona manaʻo no ka maʻalahi a me ka nani ma o kēia mau huahana. Ua lilo kēia mau mea i mea hoʻololi i ko kākou hoʻohana ʻana i ka ʻenehana.",
        "Kei - He lālā o ka hui kūʻē aupuni e kōkua iā Kaneda",
        "Screen Actors Guild Award no ka Hui Hana Keaka Kiʻekiʻe ma ka Papa Kiʻiʻoniʻoni (2017)",
        "Ua hoʻololi ka hōʻike i ke ʻano o ka nānā ʻana o nā kānaka i nā kiʻi hōʻike keiki. Hoʻohana nui ʻia ka hōʻike e nā kumu kula no ke aʻo ʻana i nā haʻawina like ʻole, e like me ke aloha ʻohana, ka hoʻomanawanui, a me ka hana pū ʻana.",
        "Final Fantasy V (1992) - Luna Hoʻonohonoho",
        "Akira Toriyama (5 ʻApelila 1955 - 1 Malaki 2024) he mea kaha kiʻi manga a he mea hoʻolālā kiʻi Kepanī. ʻO ia ka mea kākau o nā puke manga kaulana loa Dragon Ball a me Dr. Slump. Ua kōkua pū ʻo ia i ka hoʻolālā kiʻi no nā pāʻani wikiō Dragon Quest, Chrono Trigger, a me Blue Dragon. Ua make ʻo ia ma kona home ma Minami-Awaji, Hyōgo, Iāpana.",
        "Square Enix (スクウェア・エニックス, Sukuea Enikkusu) he hui hana pāʻani wikiō no Iāpana i hoʻokumu ʻia ma ka lā 1 ʻApelila 2003 ma Tōkyō, Iāpana. Ua hoʻokumu ʻia ka hui ma o ka hui pū ʻana o Square me Enix. ʻO ia kekahi o nā hui hana pāʻani kaulana loa o ka honua, i kaulana no nā moʻo pāʻani Final Fantasy me Dragon Quest.",
        "Goblin Village - Kahi e noho ai nā menehune",
        "I ka wā o ka SNES, ua hakakā nui ʻo Nintendo me Sega a me kā lākou Sega Genesis ma ʻAmelika Hui Pū ʻIa. Ma ka hoʻomaka ʻana, ua lanakila ʻo Sega ma muli o ka hoʻokuʻu mua ʻana a me kā lākou hoʻolaha maikaʻi ʻana. Akā, ma hope mai, ua lanakila ka SNES ma muli o kāna mau pāʻani kiʻekiʻe a me ka maikaʻi o ka ʻenehana.",
        "Ua hoʻokuʻu mua ʻia ma ka lā 21 Nowemapa 1994 ma ʻAmelika ʻĀkau, a ma hope mai ma Iāpana (lā 16 Kekemapa 1994) a me ʻEulopa (lā 24 Nowemapa 1994).",
        "Ua hānau ʻia ʻo Miyamoto ma Sonobe, Kyoto, Iāpana, he keiki na Iijake Miyamoto lāua ʻo Momoko. I kona wā kamaliʻi, ua noho ʻo ia ma kahi home kuʻuna Kepanī me kona ʻohana. Ua makemake nui ʻo ia i ka huakaʻi ʻana i nā ana kokoke i kona home, ka mea i hoʻoulu i kona makemake i ka ʻimi ʻana a me ka noʻonoʻo ʻana. Ua hoihoi pū ʻo ia i ka kiʻi, ka pāʻani puppet, ka hoʻokani kīkā, a me ka hana manga.",
        "Lupin III (ʻŌlelo Kepanī: ルパン三世, Rupan Sansei) he moʻolelo manga Kepanī i kākau a kiʻi ʻia e Monkey Punch. He moʻopuna o ke aihue kaulana Arsène Lupin ke kanaka nui o ka moʻolelo. Ua hoʻomaka ʻia ka moʻolelo ma ka makahiki 1967 a ua lilo i mea kaulana loa, me nā kiʻi ʻoniʻoni, nā kīwī, a me nā keluʻolu.",
        "Justice League Dark: Apokolips War - Leo ʻia e John DiMaggio",
        "Nā hoʻopiʻi mai ka Federal Trade Commission",
        "Nā mokupuni nui (e like me ʻAukekulelia)",
        "macOS: Ka ʻōnaehana hoʻohana no nā kamepiula Mac",
        "Castlevania series - He moʻolelo no ka hakakā ʻana me nā dracula",
        "Worlds of Power: Simon's Quest (1990, puke keiki)",
        "Huakaʻi Malu Onipaʻa he hanana makahiki a me ka huakaʻi mai Mauna ʻAla a i ka Hale Aliʻi ʻIolani e hoʻomanaʻo ai i ka hoʻokahuli ʻia ʻana o ka Mōʻī Liliʻuokalani a me ke Aupuni Mōʻī o Hawaiʻi i ka makahiki 1893.",
        "Ua ʻike ʻia he hana maikaʻi loa a Rumiko Takahashi",
        "Ma Mutiny, hoʻomaka ʻo Cameron lāua ʻo Donna i ka hana ʻana i kahi kahua kamaʻilio pūnaewele. Akā, kūʻē ka makua kāne o Sara iā Mutiny a hoʻokumu i kahi ʻōnaehana like, ʻo WestNet. Hoʻohana ʻo Cameron i kekahi polokalamu maikaʻi ʻole e hoʻopilikia i ko Westgroup pūnaewele. Ua haʻalele ʻo Joe iā Sara a neʻe ʻo Mutiny i Kaleponi.",
        "Ka mālama ʻana i ke pilikino ma o ka \"Private Browsing\"",
        "Ua kōkua ʻo ia me Nicola Pellow i ka hoʻomohala ʻana i ka browser pūnaewele mua no ka Classic Mac OS i kapa ʻia ʻo MacWWW.",
        "Ua male ʻo Apatow me ka mea hana kiʻi ʻoniʻoni Leslie Mann ma ka lā 9 Iune 1997. He ʻelua a lāua keiki, ʻo Maude Apatow a me Iris Apatow. Ua hana ka ʻohana holoʻokoʻa i loko o kekahi o kāna mau kiʻi ʻoniʻoni, e like me Knocked Up, Funny People, a me This Is 40.",
        "Ka makuahine o Bill. Hana ʻo ia ma ke ʻano he mea lawelawe. Ua hana mua ʻo ia he mea hula. Hoʻāhewa iā ia iho no nā pilikia olakino o Bill, no ka ʻinu ʻawa a me ka hoʻohana lāʻau ʻonoʻono i ka wā hāpai.",
        "Ua hoʻokumu i ka Palapala Kānāwai o nā Pono Kīwila",
        "Yahoo! (/jɑːhuː/) he pūnaewele lawelawe ʻAmelika i hoʻokumu ʻia ma Sunnyvale, Kaleponi ma Ianuali 1994 e Jerry Yang a me David Filo. He lālā ʻo Yahoo! o Apollo Global Management (90%) a me Verizon (10%) mai ka makahiki 2021. I kēia manawa, hāʻawi ka hui i nā lawelawe pūnaewele he nui, me ka Yahoo! Mail, Yahoo! Search, Yahoo! News, Yahoo! Finance, Yahoo! Sports a me kāna kahua hoʻolaha ʻo Yahoo Native.",
        "Ua lanakila ʻo McKenzie i ka makana National Board of Review Award no ka Hōkū Puka Hou (2018)",
        "Ka mōhai ʻana i ka mōʻī pōpeku Shohei Ohtani (2024)",
        "Ma ka makemakika, aia ʻehā hana maʻamau: ka huinahelu (+), ka lawenahelu (−), ka hoʻonui (×), a me ka māhele (÷). He helu pālua ka 4, a he helu piha, a he helu Harshad. ʻO ia kekahi o nā helu Harshad a pau ʻehā.",
        "Yuno Grinberryall: He keiki hānai a me ke keikikāne aliʻi o ka Spade Kingdom. Ua loaʻa iā ia ka puke kilo \"Four-leaf Clover\" a me ka mana makani. He lālā o ka Golden Dawn a hoʻokūkū me Asta e lilo i Aliʻi Kilo. Ua hui pū me ka ʻuhane makani ʻo Sylph (Bell). I ka wā hope, ua loaʻa iā ia ka lua o ka puke kilo me ka mana hōkū.",
        "Ma John Overton High School i Nashville, ua hōʻike ʻo Betts i kona mākaukau ma nā pāʻani like ʻole. Ma ka pōpō hulihuli, ua loaʻa iā ia ka batting average .548. Ma ka pōpō pōpeku, ua koho ʻia ʻo ia i MVP o ka District 12-AAA. Ua kaulana pū ʻo ia ma ke kinipōpō, a ua kapa ʻia ʻo ia ʻo \"Tennessee Boys Bowler of the Year\" ma 2010.",
        "He pā keleawe kula 12 ʻīniha (30 kenimika) ka laulā",
        "I hānau ʻia ʻo ia ma Kakalameko, Kaleponi, he keiki na ka mea hana kiʻiʻoniʻoni Tom Hanks a me ka mea hana kiʻiʻoniʻoni Samantha Lewes (i hānau ʻia ʻo Susan Jane Dillingham). He kaikuaʻana kāna, ʻo Elizabeth, a ma o ko kona makuakāne mare ʻana iā Rita Wilson, he ʻelua kona kaikaina hanauna, ʻo Chet Hanks a me Truman Hanks.",
        "Tommy Holmes he kanaka hoe waʻa kaulana a he mea hoʻokele moana Hawaiʻi i make i ka lā 23 ʻAukake 1993. Ua kaulana ʻo ia no kona lanakila ʻana i ka Molokai Hoe i ka makahiki 1967, kāna puke The Hawaiian Canoe, a me kona kōkua nui ʻana i ka hoʻōla hou ʻana i ke kālai waʻa Hawaiʻi.",
        "Hōkū ma ka Hollywood Walk of Fame (2004)",
        "Paena kūhelu Studio Ghibli: Mimi o Sumaseba",
        "I ka makahiki 1988, ua hoʻopau ʻo Miyazaki i ka papa moʻolelo mua a hōʻike i ia i mea Iulai 1988. I ia manawa, ua hōʻike ʻo ia ua hoʻoholo ʻo ia e hoʻokele i ke kiʻi ʻoniʻoni. Ua hoʻomanaʻo mua ʻia e lilo i kiʻi ʻoniʻoni 60-minuke, akā lilo ia i kiʻi ʻoniʻoni 102-minuke.",
        "Ua neʻe ʻo Swift i Republic Records i ka makahiki 2018, a ua hoʻokuʻu i ka puke mele electropop Lover (2019) a ua ʻimi i nā ʻano mele indie folk i nā puke mele Folklore a me Evermore i ka makahiki 2020. Ua ʻimi ʻo ia i nā ʻano pop maʻalahi ma Midnights (2022) a me The Tortured Poets Department (2024), a ua hoʻomaka e hoʻopaʻa hou i kāna mau puke mele Big Machine ma ke ʻano Taylor's VersionʻO ia hoʻi, Fearless (Taylor's Version) a me Red (Taylor's Version) i ka makahiki 2021, a laila Speak Now (Taylor's Version) a me 1989 (Taylor's Version) i ka makahiki 2023. ma muli o kahi hoʻopaʻapaʻa kuleana me ka lekoli. Ma nā makahiki 2020, ua loaʻa iā ia nā mele helu ʻekahi US \"Cardigan\", \"Willow\", \"All Too Well\", \"Anti-Hero\", \"Cruel Summer\", \"Is It Over Now?\", a me \"Fortnight\". Ua lawe ʻo ia i ʻeono huakaʻi mele, me nā mea kike e like me The Eras Tour (2023–2024), ka huakaʻi mele loaʻa kālā nui loa o nā manawa. ʻO kāna mau kiʻi ʻoniʻoni ke komo pū nei iā Miss Americana (2020), All Too Well: The Short Film (2021), a me The Eras Tour (2023)—ʻo ka kiʻi ʻoniʻoni mele loaʻa kālā nui loa.",
        "Ma Red a me 1989, ua hana ʻia nā leo o Swift ma ka lolo uila e kākoʻo i ka hana pop. ʻO kona leo ma Reputation a me Midnights hoʻokomo i nā hoʻoikaika hip-hop a me R&B e hōʻea i kekahi hoʻopuka kokoke-rap e hoʻoikaika ana i ka rhythm a me cadence ma mua o melody. Hoʻohana pinepine ʻo ia i kona kākau leo lalo ma \"Cardigan\" a me nā leo kākau haʻahaʻa a me kiʻekiʻe ma Evermore.",
        "Ua hele ʻo ia i ka Harbor High School a ma hope aku i ka American Academy of Dramatic Arts ma Los Angeles. Ua hoʻomaka kona ʻoihana hana keaka ma ka makahiki 1994, me nā ʻāpana liʻiliʻi ma nā kīwī like ʻole.",
        "Hoʻomaikaʻi i ka pilina ma waena o kānaka a me ke kaiapuni.",
        "ʻO ʻŌkuka (Orcus; nā hōʻailona: ) he hōkū hele iki peke nui ma ke kahua o nā hōkū.",
        "Ma 20 Mei 2013, ua hōʻike ʻia ua loaʻa i Yahoo a me Tumblr kekahi ʻaelike no Yahoo! Inc. e kūʻai iā Tumblr no $1.1 biliona kālā. He nui nā mea hoʻohana Tumblr i ʻoluʻolu ʻole i ka nūhou, e alakaʻi ana i kekahi e hoʻomaka i kekahi palapala noi, e hana ana i kokoke i 170,000 nā pūlima. Ua mau ʻo David Karp ma ke ʻano ʻo ke CEO a ua hoʻokō ʻia ka hana kūʻai ma 20 Iune 2013.",
        "Ua hānau ʻia ʻo Arment ma Columbus, Ohio. Ua komo ʻo ia i ke Kulanui ʻo Allegheny ma Meadville, Penekelewinia a ua puka me kāna Bachelor of Science ma ka ʻepekema kamepiula ma 2004.",
        "Tower of Terror: He holoholo haʻahaʻa me ka moʻolelo kupaianaha o kahi mea ʻimi waiwai maikaʻi ʻole a me kāna hōʻiliʻili mea kahiko.",
        "ʻO Diego Rivera (hānau ma: 8 ʻKekemapa 8, 1886 – 24 ʻNowemapa, 1957) he mea kekahi mai Mekiko.",
        "Twice Showcase Live Tour 2018 \"Candy Pop\" (2018)"
    ]
}
